					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Breaenna ZaTeeva</b> on <b>September 22, 2003, 11:52:59 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"> ;D<br />  Ok, hi all for one...<br /><br />   Next off, this top ten list.  there seems to be a few small problems.<br /><br /> 1)Spirit of Verzi at #9? come on, Ive never heard of them.  Either they are too stuck on themselves to sday &quot;hi&quot; to a lil dark elf like myself, OR, they dont exist...<br /><br /> b)You cant have more than one guild at any rank.  No ties allowed...<br /><br />Thirdly)You have OA tied with DF at 11.  Thats just wrong.  I dont want to put my guild down but 11? come on..  13 is the best number in the world...  Why cant we be 13?  We prolly better than 13 but I like the number and OA is a good guild.  Lotsa friends there.<br /><br /> Next up)I think AC should be ranked higher just cuz some of them say &quot;hi&quot; tome regularly.<br /><br />Last)Ive noticed Ascent has a few Paladins in their guild.  That sure as hell is a downgrade cuz Paladins where that &quot;im all shiney and shit&quot; gear.  So they should be pushed back until they realize that the dark side will overtake Norrath. And they cant stop me cuz they luv me...<br /><br /><br />ps. Thansk for letting DF be ranked.  They have been the best friends/guild that I have ever seen in game.  Always willing to help and always caring.  They dont badmouth guilds that jump on the targets we are after, they dont badmouth anyone in game unless its me and ur a pally, and they actually believe RL comes before a stupid game.  So after those few notes, I would like a recall.  Clinton got one, can Dragons Fist?<br /><br /><br /><br />Baroness Breaenna ZaTeeva\<br /><br /><br />Im sure you all know me....</div>
					<br />
