					Post by: <b>RNWatcher</b> on <b>September 25, 2003, 12:47:14 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">before we go and throw a reign of storms is so awsome party we need to remeber on thing,  they didnt get to the elemental planes with out ascent holding there hands and killing RZTW for them and showing them how to do it.  yup they have done alot with less thats a fact.  but they dont have there vt keys and lets face it VT gear &gt; ornate gear.  anyone how knows anything knows that vt has the best gear in the land proble even better then most elemental stuff,  but ya vt is outdated cuse it was 3 exp. ago.  and one that thinks vt is a waste of time hasn't been to vt and seen the loots that drop there.<br />here's a good list for ya<br />1. Ascent(time,quam kill)<br />2. EiE/DA(time)<br />3. Arirang(ele.flagged and most of the gods)<br />4. Forsaken(ele.flagged and and huge progress in a short time)<br />5. FoT(ele flagged and doing there best from letting forsaken progress,but thats about it)<br />6. RoS( man RZTW is tough lets get ascent to kill it for us and then say we did it on our own. ele.flagged but not on there own accord. gradz again on the RZTW kill ascent RoS couldnt have done it with out you)<br />7. Union of Power ( VT keyed , a few PoP boss's,  when they make there start at PoP flagging they will be in ele. planes in no time)<br />8. SoD and Friends ( same most vt keyed not to sure on the pop progress but a very friendly bunch and they to will see the ele. planes very soon also.)<br />9. Hegemony ( some ssra named , bert kill but thats about it)<br />10. MV,SoV ( nether have made a push to ether vt or pop and if so havent made a push to hard to turn any heads)</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Delfino Soulreaver</b> on <b>September 25, 2003, 01:18:38 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I agree with most of your list, RNwatcher, but that cheap shot at RoS was pretty stupid.  Your accusation could have been valid if RoS never attempted RZTW before ascent helped them and got their strat from it, and if the majority of the guild was flagged because of it.  Unfortunately, it just happens to be the opposite of the truth.  RoS attempted RZTW a couple times before ascent invited them, and they got really close each time.  It wasn't close to a majority of the raiding force that was flagged, so it isn't like Ascent held their hands at all.  RoS went after RZTW not too long after and took him down solo, using the same strat that they used on their first attempts.  I watched these attempts because my RL friend is in RoS, so I know what I'm talking about.  Not sure what guild your in, that might be why you feel like bashing them, but maybe your just upset that ascent felt like inviting some of RoS to help them take out RZTW when they didn't have quite the numbers on to do it themselves.</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Kinladar</b> on <b>September 25, 2003, 03:16:52 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">RNwatchers knows very little. <br /><br />1) Ascent<br />2) EiE/DA<br />3-4) Arirang-FoT (Equal Kills list)<br />5-6) RoS-Forsaken<br /><br /><br />The top 6 seem to be the most in contention. <br /><br />Fires of Time has killed Fennin Ro twice, and the Mystial Arbitor of Earth Twice. Have also mastered the Avatar of Dust in Air, which can be a challenging target in itself. <br /><br />Forsaken and RoS are where FoT was 3-4 months ago. Starting to gear up, and will take at least that long if not longer before they are really geared to a point to start working on further progression. Arirang had the time they needed, and they moved forward. <br /><br />No one just jumps into Elemental Planes and starts killing the Elemental Gods to my knowledge. Ascent had the Elementals to themselves for a while, so probably geared up the fastest. The EiE/DA had it shortly there after. <br /><br />Arirang, FoT, Forsaken and RoS will be in competition for the same mobs to gear up and go farther faster. <br /><br />Call it what you will, but Arirang, and FoT are far far ahead of Forsaken and RoS, and unless something radically changes, Arirang and FoT are in the race to see who will next get to Time. Arirang to my knowledge has not downed Cornaiv, Xegony, or the Raithe Council. They have not killed the majority of the Gods.<br /><br />I see Forsaken and RoS in the race to see who will next kill an Elemental God. Forsaken has raw numbers. RoS has great players and a great guild mentality. Only time will tell.<br /></div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Kinladar</b> on <b>September 25, 2003, 03:25:36 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Now, since there is one person from VN boards that I personally feel is an antagonist posting here, and with an anon name, that I tend to not care for, one warning to all people.<br /><br />I will not allow this thread to become a flame ridden mess like the one on VN is. There is a rants and raves section for all the flaming you want. I want this thread kept clean, and discussed rationally.<br /><br />Everyone is entitled to thier opinions. RNWatcher has stated in a calm post his opinion. I don't share that same one, but that is fine.<br /> <br />Any flaming in this thread will not be tolerated, the offending post will be deleted, and the person who posted it banned. <br /><br />I don't care what guild the member is from, mine, yours or your brothers. Fortunately no one has come close, but I felt it best to get this out in the open ahead of time. Everyone has been given fair notice.</div>
