					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">To clear some stuff up about Verzi.<br /><br />Yes we are a European guild, and we are casual at raiding. only do it 4-5 times a week or so. Which puts us on CET time.<br /><br />We have killed everything in Ssra except Cursed and Emperor, and are currently working on Emperor keys.<br /><br />We have killed all PoP tier 1 mobs.<br />Did PoV dragon on first attempt with 38 people (including 2 boxed clerics etc) and have done Caprin Cycle in CoD a few times. We have done the first 2 trials in HoH, and one test run against the Dragon on 3rd trial with 29 people.<br /><br />Currently waiting on Agnarr and HoH trial 3 to be up on our raid time, and also working on Bertox ring.<br /><br />Does that place us above UoP? Frankly I do not know, it depends on if you place Tier 2 boss mobs above VT level. And I dont really care, to tell the truth :)</div>
