					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Hmm, this must be gang up on Gonaiel Day.<br /><br />But on the other question, and yes, I am biased, FoT will make Time before Forsaken.<br /><br />We&#039;ve done Xegony multiple times, and most people have thier Air Shield, and of course we&#039;ve done Fennin many times. <br /><br />We are extremely close to Rathe, Cornaiv is just timing issues, and I think we can resolve those fairly soon. Just refinments needed there. We&#039;ve made a few mistakes here or there each time, we&#039;re just learning from them now, and we get a bit further every time we go. <br /><br />Gotta give props to those guilds who have gone before us though. Fennin is really easy, Xegony just takes numbers. Rathe takes numbers, and certain classes to be there more so than Xegony. Cornaiv is just a balls to the wall race. /shrug we&#039;ll get &#039;em.<br /><br />I honestly think that we will get our Rathe kill down before Christmas. Cornaiv shortly after the Rathe, possibly also before Christmas. </div>
