					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">VT is better gear per time than PoP IF you dont factor in the time required to getting the entire guild keyed up for it.  Add that in and it you can make an argument that it&#039;s better to just skip the whole VT thing.  There are some nice focus effects though on VT items that you might not get until tier 3+ in PoP though.<br /><br />BM has killed AL and XTC multiple times each but it will probably be a while before we can hit emp just to trying to get a guild with an avg of 25 hours or less per week players to get keyed up for him.<br /><br />BoT tower bosses have arguably as good of weapons as Ssra or better even, not to mention some tier2 events (bertox and sayrn)</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Jeet</b> on <b>December 17, 2003, 07:54:38 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: chidder $txt[176] December 15, 2003, 07:48:33 am</div><div class="quote"> Pre-Elemental stuff is way worse than VT stuff + theres much less of it<br />These are the only mobs pre ele i cosider worth farming.<br />Jiva <br />RZ<br />MM<br />TZ <br /></div><br /><br />It took me 2 hours to compile this so please reply with something better than what you wrote above.  Ok here goes.  FYI since we all agree VT resists are better (more balanced would be the better description) I&#039;ll omit resists.<br /><br />Compiled grab bag of AHR stuff:<br /><br />+3% Channeling<br />+5% Abjuration<br />+10% Alteration <br />+3% Conjuration <br />+2% Meditate <br />+10% Evocation <br />+8% Dodge <br /><br />AC: 25-80 <br />Range of +15-20 in stats<br />HP: 100-125 <br />Mana: 100-125 <br /> <br />Effect:Vengeance 3,6,7 (15-45atk)<br />Effect: Call of Fire (65dd proc)<br />Effect:Flowing Thought 3,7 (3-7 mana regen)<br />Effect: Koadic&#039;s Expansive Mind (+250 mana)<br />Effect: Blessing of Vah Kerrath (8DS/Mana/HP)<br /><br />Focus Effect: Touch of Judgement (Increase healing 23%)<br />Effect: Brilliance of Ro ( Increase Effective Casting Level by 20)<br />Effect: Preservation of the Akheva  (Decrease spell cost 18%)<br />Effect: Focus of the Orb  (Decrease spell cost 12%)<br />Focus Effect: Focus of Distance  (Increase spell range 20%)<br />Focus Effect: Conundrum of Speed  (Spell haste 15%)<br /><br />--------------------------<br /><br />Grab bag of stuff Ssnakes listed + Agnar<br /><br />HP:100-135 <br />MANA:100-135 <br />AC 10-20<br />Stats Ranging between 10-20<br /><br />EFFECT: Vengeance III (+15 atk)<br />Effect: Aura of Daring (+20 atk, 2hp regen)<br />Effect: Aura of Bravery (+30 atk, 3hp regen)<br />EFFECT: AURA OF REGENERATION (3hp regen)<br />EFFECT: FLOWING THOUGHT III (3 mana regen)<br /><br />FOCUS EFFECT:CONSERVATION OF SOLUSEK (Decrease detrimental mana cost 15%)<br />FOCUS EFFECT: Haste of Solusek (Spell haste 15%)<br />Focus Effect: Conservation of Mithaniel (Decrease Beneficial spell cost 15%)<br />Focus Effect: Anger of Solusek (Increase spell damage 25%)<br />Focus Effect: Druzzil&#039;s Distance (Increase spell range 20%)<br />Focus Effect: Speed of Solusek (Spell haste 18%)<br />Focus Effect: Marr&#039;s Gift  (Increase healing 25%)<br />Focus Effect: Fury of E&#039;ci  (Increase cold spell damage 30%)<br />FOCUS EFFECT: SPELL HASTE IV  (Spell haste 15%)<br />FOCUS EFFECT: MANA PRESERVATION IV  (Decrease mana cost 10%)<br />FOCUS EFFECT: FURY OF DRUZZIL  (Increase magic spell damage 30%)<br />FOCUS EFFECT: HASTE OF DRUZZIL  (Spell haste 18%)<br />FOCUS EFFECT: SPEED OF MITHANIEL  (Spell haste 25%)<br />  <br />weapons<br /><br />16/20 1hb<br />Effect: Rotting Flesh<br /><br />Skill: 2Hs<br />32/48<br />Effect: Enraging Blow  <br /><br />16/19 1hp Fire damage + 1<br />Effect: Wrath of Fire <br /><br />18/20 Fists<br />EFFECT: STUNNING BLOW<br /><br />33/30 Bow<br />EFFECT: JUDGEMENT OF ICE<br /><br />15/19 1hs<br />EFFECT: OBSIDIAN SHATTER<br /><br />51/37 2hb<br />EFFECT: KNIGHT&#039;S BLESSING<br /><br />20/25 1hs <br />EFFECT: WRATH OF WIND<br /><br />36/32 Bow<br /><br />17/20 1hs<br />Effect: EMBER STRIKE<br /><br />--------------------------<br /><br />Now like I said, minus stuff like the legs/BP/neck off AHR, where exactly is there a shock and awe differential in stats.   Don&#039;t expect me to bring up everything in VT because it doesnt get better than AHR loot.<br /><br />Where you do take a big hit that no one mentioned yet is AC, but thats basically because unless you count ornate(which isn&#039;t that hard to get) you won&#039;t be acquiring legs or BP&#039;s.  Mana regen you don&#039;t need near as much in PoP compared to Luclin.  The skill mods are door prizes.  HP/manawise and focus effects the edge clearly goes to PoP pre-elemental.<br /><br />To the person referring to weapons in Ssra etc.  Bloodfrenzy is top of the line Luclin.  Everyone wanted it.  16/20 1hs.  Goldenrod, another one - 40/32 2hb.   My point being, from a pure dps point of view, the pre-el stuff easily matches stuff from Luclin. </div>
