					Post by: <b>Dwalion SoulVoid</b> on <b>December 17, 2003, 05:16:44 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">This is much better.  This is more &#039;ranger-green&#039; ya.<br /><br /><br />Ok for everyone my opinion on the top 10 guild list of all time.<br /><br />1.  Avatars of Discord/Arcane Legacy<br />2.  Ascent<br />3.  Altered Destiny/Dragon Knight<br />4.  EiE/DA<br />5.  Eastern Keep<br />6.  Fires of Time<br />7.  Forsaken<br />8.  Mythmakers<br />9.  Harbinger of Storms<br />10. Exiled Legion<br /><br />In one form or another Axiom Shift, Dragon Force, Circle of Sol, Ancient Souls, Union of Power, Warlords of Wrath, Vikings and JPN Alliance could be plugged in here.<br /><br />Not talking about reputation really, just from my eq exp from what I have heard and remember when coming up to now when I sit playing /gems.  Only reason I name Vikings cause that had to been the largest guild I had seen for about a period of two and half years.<br /><br />Being former Ancient Souls (Pre Kunark-Kunark), Dragon Force (Velious-Luclin) and now in Arirang (Velious-Luclin-PoP), (only high end guilds I have been in). They each hold a special place with me so maybe a little biased *).<br /><br />Reason I do not put Arirang there is purely because for some reason the guild name alone irrates people *).<br /><br />All guilds have classy people in it, some have joined other guilds, some retired, some keep the game fun and interesting and that is what it is really all about.<br /><br />I think first kills are great and earn a ton of respect and I also think that guilds that have been doing their business for really long periods of time is fantastic too.</div>
