					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Tilien Venator</b> on <b>December 18, 2003, 11:21:37 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: A Mammal $txt[176] December 15, 2003, 08:32:05 pm</div><div class="quote">While its true that Time has a funnel affect I think your missin the point as to what I was saying. Lots of guilds in Elementals makes for alot of people with alot of good gear on. Even the mighty Ssnakess is still wearin Elemental gear. I mean alot of Ascent members which have been in Time for lots of time will still have Elemental pieces on. <br /><br />Which brings me to my point.. <br />All these people with Elemental gear and lets say 30% of this pool (of people) with Time gear are going to own a expansion that doesn&#039;t at least present time quality challanges. <br /><br />To give you a example:<br />Say Forsaken, FoT, Conviction, RoS, Hegemony, and Arirang Farm elementals for the next 2 and 1/2 months. The majority of their members are going to have quite a few Elemental pieces. If you step back and look at Luclin to PoP you see something totally different. About 3 guilds or less that had a few members in VT gear on adverage per server. I mean you get alot of gear in the system cause of 3 day spawns compared to 7 day spawns. <br /><br />Point being that while we step into the &quot;Black Hole&quot; of the next expasion you will see about 8 to 10 guilds that are even in gear going after the same targets. Aside from Ascent and Dol/EiE that will have just a fair percentage advantage from Time gear. More and more guilds will step into Time as well, as time marches on, which will give them the same advantage.<br /></div><br /><br />What you&#039;re forgetting to take into consideration is that the more guilds in Ele, the more diluted the pool gets. When ascent 1st got into Ele, they got ALL the l00t every 3 days. When DA/EIE 1st got in, we had to &quot;share&quot; those (I think it&#039;s about 40ish drops every 3 days) with Ascent for a month or 2, then we too got all the l00ts to ourselves for awhile. I can&#039;t remember how long FoT, if ever, got ele to themselves with out us, airiang, forsaken, etc there to &quot;share&quot; those 40ish drops among all their members. <br /><br />Figure that your avg ele guild needs to be able to field 50ish people and usually have about 2x that total members each with 20 slots to gear up. So 2000 slots say per guild at 40 every 3 days would take 150 days if you have Ele to yourselves the whole time. Now of course you don&#039;t need to fill ALL 20 slots on everyone, but still. Now add, what is it, 6 guilds now all trying to pharm Ele at the same time and you are looking at 600+ people and 12,000 slots that need to be filled.<br /><br />So instead of the the drops filling 2% of your total need (if you had the planes all to yourself) every 3 days, the drops are now only filling .33% of the total pools gear needs.<br /><br />So, while later guilds might be elemental flagged, their total gear avg will be alot lower then earlier guilds were after &quot;X&quot; amount of time spent in Elementals. When SoE designs Ele level encounters for the next expansion they are going to use beta buffed toons will fullish elemental gear. Not guilds that have had to share the drops with 6 other guilds. So there will not be as many toons running around with alot of good on. 1, 2 or 3 items per avg doesn&#039;t really do much over all.<br /><br /></div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
