					Post by: <b>EQSysquella</b> on <b>December 18, 2003, 11:28:46 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">I can&#039;t remember how long FoT, if ever, got ele to themselves with out us, airiang, forsaken, etc there to &quot;share&quot; those 40ish drops among all their members. <br /></div><br /><br />Let&#039;s just say we are nit picking ele atm.. going to targets that we know wont drop rot loot anymore.. no longer need ifir&#039;s, no longer need pere drums, we have like 15 sews, 14 bow.. all our bards have hydro mask, etc..  ele armor = going to twinks.. <br /><br />our farmage is pwn.. we are ready to enter time though (jus need to be to have 1 more wiz at next cornaiv, and 11-15 seconds faster on next rahte &gt;&lt;</div>
