					Post by: <b>Grem</b> on <b>December 19, 2003, 09:32:07 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">From vnboards, all time RN guild list<br /><br />Moo. <br /><br />This is an incomplete list, but putting it here for people (delheru and anyone else) to make corrections. My poor memory and perhaps some bias/ignorance makes my list somewhat shakey. <br /><br />Original - Vox Nagafen CT, Inny, PoF clears <br />Avatars of Discord 10 all content <br />Exiled Legion 9 all content <br />Dol Amroth 7 <br />Harbingers of Storm 7 <br />Eastern Keep 7 <br />Altered Destiny 2 late nagefen kill <br /><br />Kunark - Trakanon, VP, Epics, New CT/Inny <br />Avatars of Discord/EL 9 all content save a full VP clear <br />Altered Destiny/Dragon Force 10 first Trakanon, VP clear <br />Dol Amroth 7 <br />Eastern Keep 7 <br />Harbingers of Storm 7 <br /><br />Velious - Dain, Yelinak, Tormax, Primal/Sleepers Tomb, North ToV, HoT, Statue, AoW, Tunare, CT V2.0 <br />Ascent 10 all content almost all firsts <br />Avatars of Discord 9 <br />Eastern Keep 8 <br />Arirang 7 <br />Dol Amroth/EiE 3 <br />Dragon Force 2 very late kills of first brood, west tov dragons <br /><br /><br /><br />Luclin - THO, Ssra, VT, New Vulak <br />Ascent 10 all content almost all firsts <br />DA/EIE 7 velious content slightly after DF, progressed far in luclin afterwards, almost to VT <br />Arirang 6 <br />Avatars of Discord 6 mid luclin content, disbanded (after df though i think) <br />Dragon Force 4 velious content, disbanded halfway through <br />Warlords of Wrath 3 velious content behind df, da/eie <br /><br />Planes of Power - Tactics RZ, Elemental Planes, Fennin, Xegony, Coirnav, Rathe, Time, Quarm <br />Ascent 10 all content all firsts <br />DA/EIE 7 finally quarm <br />Fires of Time 5 elementals <br />Forsaken 4 elementals <br />Union of Power 3 elementals?? <br />Hegemony 2 <br />Reign oF Swords 2 <br />Arirang 2 are they still around? <br /><br /><br />-----signature----- <br /><br />Glayde Xul &lt;Ascent&gt; <br />Fluffy Bardling <br />Settlers of Catan http://www-personal.umich.edu/~tle/settlers/settlers.html <br />http://www.bat.org/help/finger.php?str=Backlash <br />Cows are cute and fluffy and nice, just like bardlings and moomin! </div>
