					Post by: <b>Tillain</b> on <b>December 19, 2003, 01:47:03 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">posted on the other board...<br /><br />&quot;Velious - Dain, Yelinak, Tormax, Primal/Sleepers Tomb, North ToV, HoT, Statue, AoW, Tunare, CT V2.0 <br />Ascent 10 all content almost all firsts <br />Avatars of Discord 9 <br />Eastern Keep 8 <br />Arirang 7 <br />Dol Amroth/EiE 3 <br />Dragon Force 2 very late kills of first brood, west tov dragons &quot; <br /><br />1st Kills: <br />Dain = EK <br />Velk = EK <br />VInd = AoD (Not positive on this one) <br />Statue = AoD <br />CT v2.0 = Pirates of Velious <br />Yelinak = AoD/AL/EL for V1.0, AoD for V2.0 <br />Sleeper = AoD <br />First Primal = Ascent <br />Ntov clear = Ascent <br />Tormax = AoD <br />Tunare = Ascent <br />AoW = Ascent <br />West Wing Tov dragons = AoD <br /><br />I think Velious was pretty equal <br /><br /><br />------------------<br /><br />&quot;Kunark - Trakanon, VP, Epics, New CT/Inny <br />Avatars of Discord/EL 9 all content save a full VP clear <br />Altered Destiny/Dragon Force 10 first Trakanon, VP clear <br />Dol Amroth 7 <br />Eastern Keep 7 <br />Harbingers of Storm 7 &quot; <br /><br />-Dol Amroth could MAYBE kill trak at the end of kunark when they allied with Fin De Cycle. Forget if that was in velious or the end of Kunark though. <br /><br />-Dunno why you say AD/DF cleared VP. Nobody on RN cleared VP during kunark, and the only guilds in VP were EK and AoD/EL/AL. AoD etc got first kills on Hosh and Silverwing. EK got first kill on Xygloz(sp). <br /><br />-Trak/VS were on a rotation between AoD/EK, it was not really a formal rotation but they switched it up usually (members from both wanted both bp and legs) AD/DK killed trak first yes, but they fell way behind after they did that. They should NOT be 10...7 maybe and EK should be 9 with AoD. Rodcet as a server sucked up until Velious. <br /><br />-From about mid kunark through the first 1/3rd of Velious, EK was at the highest rank its ever been on the server and at one point it was arguably the top guild (I SAID ARGUABLY!!!!). They definatly shouldn&#039;t be ranked below AD/DF for this time period.<br /><br />Only thing I dont agree with Del on is Kunark....AD/DK killed trak first yes, but they didn&#039;t do anything after that. In terms of epics, trak/vs farming AoD would be 10, EK would be 9 imo. AD/DK were really late on epics, and if you look at the so called Elite weapon of the time (the warrior epic due to the hard fights at the time) it goes like this : 1.Dyvim(AoD), 2. Ghime(AoD), 3. Yohon(EK), 4. Dergin(EK), 5. Grimdar(AL), 6. Crimsonblade(EK), 7. Tillain(EK), 8. Thun(EL?)....first for AD was Krow I think and that wasn&#039;t until pretty far into Velious. My rank would go...<br /><br />10 - AoD/EL/AL....total zerg at time :p<br />9 - EK...did the stuff with lesser numbers, had no firsts but was AoD&#039;s main competition.<br />7 - HoS, first VS, and still killed it some after that too<br />7 - AD/DK, Killed Trak first, did nothing else really though.<br />4 - Dol/Fin, they killed trak near the end I think.<br /><br /></div>
