					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Gon -<br /><br />I don&#039;t think it was implied that farming pre-elemental loot vs  VT was &quot;smarter&quot;.  Merely, a comparison was made between the two with the suggestion: you &quot;don&#039;t need&quot; VT gear to advance into the elemental planes. <br /><br />Moreover, I don&#039;t think anyone will argue the fact you can &quot;gear up&quot; a guild faster in one VT clear then a week&#039;s worth of pre-ele farming. <br /><br />To your main premise about VT.  I would concur those 2 months of farming VT definately benefited your (UoP&#039;s) casters for FT , mana pool and the all important but often overlooked resists.  <br /><br />In turn, once you (UoP) begin to focus on higher PoP content, those months spent in VT will pay off emmensely. Until that time though, you guys are still around the tail end of the top 10.<br /><br />cheers<br /></div>
