					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I think this is as un-biased as possible:<br /><br />Current: Out-dated Content -&gt; Tactics RZ -&gt; Elemental Planes MOBs -&gt; Fennin -&gt; Xegony -&gt; Coirnav -&gt; Rathe -&gt; Time Gods -&gt; Quarm <br /><br />Ascent: 10 - All content, all firsts <br />DA/EIE: 8 - Time cleared, quarm dead <br />FoT: 6 - Fennin/Xegony down, extremely close calls on Rathe/Coirnav <br />Forsaken: 5 - Fennin/Xegony down, PoEB access <br />Conviction: 4 - Xegony access, working on Fennin/Xegony, came a long way in a short time with low #s <br />Reign of Swords: 3 - Elemental access <br />Hegemony: 3 - Elemental access <br />Union of Power: 2 - VT clears <br />Arirang: ? - Not sure what they&#039;ve been up to... back to Ssra/VT?</div>
