					Post by: <b>chidder</b> on <b>December 26, 2003, 01:01:26 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Xerno $txt[176] December 25, 2003, 09:15:13 pm</div><div class="quote">I think this is as un-biased as possible:<br /><br />Current: Out-dated Content -&gt; Tactics RZ -&gt; Elemental Planes MOBs -&gt; Fennin -&gt; Xegony -&gt; Coirnav -&gt; Rathe -&gt; Time Gods -&gt; Quarm <br /><br />Ascent: 10 - All content, all firsts <br />DA/EIE: 8 - Time cleared, quarm dead <br />FoT: 6 - Fennin/Xegony down, extremely close calls on Rathe/Coirnav <br />Forsaken: 5 - Fennin/Xegony down, PoEB access <br />Conviction: 4 - Xegony access, working on Fennin/Xegony, came a long way in a short time with low #s <br />Reign of Swords: 3 - Elemental access <br />Hegemony: 3 - Elemental access <br />Union of Power: 2 - VT clears <br />Arirang: ? - Not sure what they&#039;ve been up to... back to Ssra/VT?<br /></div><br /><br /> Arirang above Conviction? Many more past kills but  they are sapposidly just reforming and recruiting. They lost alot to the new Server Xfer policy. This is still a undecided area Arirang could easily bounce back or they could just fall completly. It should be evident by the end of jan<br /><br />The quote of &quot;Conviction: 4 - Xegony access, working on Fennin/Xegony,&quot; Xegony access isnt exactly a good mile stone. The real guide would be how much your geared up in ele&#039;s which is higher than RoS / Heg for sure but killing Dust isnt really too hard once you get it down. A better jugde would be full fire clear? Full Air clear? PoeB keyed? Offassa kill (I think most would say he is the hardest mob pre Gods)? Not trying to put you guys down just saying there are better ways to judge progress</div>
