					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Poor Grem, we are ruining his Internet Experience with mindless drivel...<br /><br />Only thing going on since the list stays about the same anymore.<br /><br />1 Ascent<br />2 EiE/DA<br />3 FoT<br />4 Forsaken<br />5 Arirang <br />6 Conviction<br />7 Reign of Swords<br />8 Hegemony<br />9 Union of Power<br />10 (Who would make a reasonable 10?)<br /><br />Since FoT was able to do back to back god FK&#039;s, and Forsaken has yet to get a Second Xegony Kill, the gap is growing between the two quite a bit. Have also heard a few rumors that the only reason they even got the first kill was due to some outside help. As to the validity of those claims, they are totally baseless, but tossed in for the Drama it will create alone.</div>
