					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>/-|verse Thule</b> on <b>January 06, 2004, 02:40:14 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">BrewMasters have generally followed heg/mv/uop.  mv is no more, heg zoomed up fast, and uop is still ahead of us.<br /><br />I am not sure how/what Apothesis is up to.  A lot of the guilds about our level tend to just keep a low profile and dont get into the whole &quot;ranking&quot; thing so it&#039;s much harder to nail down.<br /><br />Server must definately be getting smaller, cuz I dont even see any even semi-serious consistant raiding guilds behind us hitting NToV or Luclin rares.  The only people we have to fight for those mobs are guilds that are further in progression than us just gearing twinks or rekindling memories or bored taking mobs once in a while. But hey, that&#039;s a quite comfortable spot for us!</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
