					Title: <b>Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Kinladar</b> on <b>January 14, 2004, 11:27:45 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Very Interesting Development with Arirang coming out of the blue and killing Xegony yesterday. This certainly shakes things up a bit for Forsaken, since the Time zone difference and Patches will prolly play as much a roll in which of these guilds can get into Time along with skill levels and all the other good things. <br /><br />Some things about why I;m posting the list as I have. It&#039;s too close to call on all the elemental guilds. They&#039;ve all killed some stuff, but nothing really noteworthy. What will push one ahead of the rest is a god kill.<br /><br />So for the time being, with all the Ties, it will be a shorter list, with more names per level in my opinion.<br /><br />If Arirang comes back with a second Xegony Kill soon, then I would rank them a solid number 4 over Forsaken, since reports I&#039;ve heard are that Forsaken as attempted her a few times since the first kill, but have not been able to pull it off since. A second Kill from Arirang would tip it in thier favor IMHO.<br /><br />1 Ascent<br />2 EiE/DA<br />3 Fires of Time<br />4 (Tie) Forsaken and Arirang<br />5 (ties) Conviction - Reign of Swords - Hegemony<br /><br />(Writer&#039;s note - I&#039;m bored as shit at work today, and had nothing better to do, other than this.)</div>
					<br />
