					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I never really grasped what made Ofossaa so hard for people. We keep finding it up if we&#039;re bored. I mean yea, it was a huge PITA when the resist check was -400 (or was it -350?). Anyway when it stuck on like 70% of AEs.<br /><br />Now it&#039;s awful easy to resist though, and that makes it just a beatdown. Unless of course you people have less RGC:s than we do (possible, but just laziness, since they are easy to get now). Worse resists I just am not buying. If you needed 700CR to resist it I&#039;d be willing to go along with the claim, but I swear my resists haven&#039;t really moved up lots since VT (which had excellent resists).<br /><br /><br /><br />Anyway Krziik is much more troublesome for us too. During the last 2 months Krziik has forced us to camp&amp;regroup more often than ANY other mob in the game. I have no idea why that is, but we&#039;ve just waltzed in and killed it -once- so far. Of course it gets a huge beatdown after the wipe, but the wipe became almost tradition (broke it the last time though).</div>
