					Post by: <b>Domaris</b> on <b>February 10, 2004, 10:02:05 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">The list is cool and love seeing our name mentioned :) . However I see things in kind of a different light - you have your 1 2 and 3 guilds (Ascent, FoT, DA/EiE) and then you have all the rest. Basically meaning that you have guilds whose sole purporse is raiding, then you have guilds that are capable of raiding (altho not on the same scale as those guilds that dedicate the time the aforementioned guilds do) but it isn&#039;t their main pursuit.<br /><br />One of the things I love about OA, is I used to be in a different guild and remember raiding with OA, who only at the time had maybe 5 active members. But because Cudget is such a bad ass and knows his s.hit so well, we have grown to over 200 active members (including bots and twinks of course). Our raids average between 40 and 50 people (had about 50 when we took Terris down this weekend). Its just cool knowing Outcast has survived uber guilds and small guilds alike to grow from almost being spanked by the guild disband folks who do occasional sweeps, to being a respected raid force, and still being able to feel family like.<br /><br />So yeah the list is way cool but that accomplishment in itself means more to me then a number  ;D and who knows maybe 1 day we may crack the top 10  :P</div>
