					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Honest opinion?<br /><br />I think they are a serious contender. They are a what, 3 month old guild with a buncha raw apps and downing Xegony? If FoT were still restricted to Elementals, I would be very concerned.<br /><br />They are kicking ass and taking names. This guild has a very ascent style of making things happen, and rapidly. <br /><br />I don&#039;t have a huge personal opinion about Forsaken as a guild. But any guild that in three months from forming downs Xegony is noteworthy. Granted many of them picked up raiding exp from RoS, but alot of the guild is raw new members. <br /><br />Props to thier leadership for a focused and ambitious plan. Actually makes me envious to a degree.<br /><br />Considering this is a top 10 style thread, and this catapults Conviction into the race for Time that Forsaken and Arirang are in, it&#039;s also worth hearing everyone&#039;s opinion.<br /><br />The last comment was just something that Conviction has not to deal with spawn races much. Ascent and EiE/DA have had a few, EiE/DA and FoT have had a few conflicts, along with the Forsaken and FoT conflicts. It&#039;s bound to happen a spawn will be contested. How will Conviction deal with it?<br /><br />You don&#039;t get to the top of the list without having t for one spawn or another.<br /><br />If you can&#039;t take some opinions, and want to view it as a flame Chidder... there&#039;s not much I can say.</div>
