					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Oh btw.. Conviction had a grand total of 14 people from RoS :p The first round of reflagging yielded a raid force of ~28-40 per raid (highest ever was 55 for rz and it plumetted after that). Elemental farm mobs were an option, but the raidforce was too small to even 15% up to Sol Ro&#039;s room. Therefore, after about 2 months of raiding small, apps were opened again. They reflagged with Coirnav/Rathe as their targets so they gathered up about an 80 man raid force. Their reflagging period was complete after *10 days*, there was no going back and hitting stupid targets over and over. *10 days* after completing the reflag with this brand new bunch of people... Xegony falls first attempt of the day... they made one horrible attempt at Xegony with a 35ish(?) man raid force a long time ago, which I wouldn&#039;t even count as an attempt. Besides that attempt, the only previous experience they had was the day before... yea they kick ass and will be huge contenders soon as long as the officers are around.</div>
