					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">fill me in on why you believe Migatol is a bad guild leader, for I must still be ignorant over the past year that I&#039;ve been in UoP.  No guild leader is perfect or can be liked by everyone, but generalized attacks like that bring only the sounds of children whining to this board.  If you have a problem with Migatol, that&#039;s all good and fine, but don&#039;t degrade a guild as a whole just because you happen to disagree/dislike the leader. <br /><br />Also, what have they changed to PoP and even expantions since then, that make getting to the elementals so much easier then when forsaken got there? </div>
