					Post by: <b>Delfino Soulreaver</b> on <b>April 05, 2004, 05:53:56 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Guess next time I feel like asking a simple question and expecting a civil answer I will take my questions elsewhere.  UoP for the most part probably has done barely any GoD trials/explorations.  Yes LDoN has helped some of the guild, but I would be willing to wager that it has not played a significant role in us getting to the elementals.  <br /><br />   I haven&#039;t a clue who you are, Callon, but your childish remarks only allow me to assume that you have some kind of problem against anyone that isn&#039;t up to your &quot;standards&quot; of abilities.  It is sad that you have to compare my question about the differences between two guilds with parts of the male anatomy.  Yes these types of boards are pretty much ego fillers, but for those of us that would like legitimate answers to questions like these, there is no where else to go.  I guess like Leeandra&#039;s posts about migatol, I&#039;m just too ignorant to understand these things.<br /><br />    </div>
