					Post by: <b>Delheru</b> on <b>April 21, 2004, 09:45:42 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">GoD drops a lot of phase4/5 PoTime quality items from fast respawning and fairly easy mobs. Conviction at least has shown the ability to take these out without PoTime.<br /><br />Arirang failed that one, but I suspect having like 40% of the maximum allowed people hurt them as well :P  I&#039;m sure you can skip PoTime, but your members need to be extremely skilled on an individual level, and there needs to be a lot of initiative spread around the guild. IMHO clearly a harder task than going to PoTime, where the leadership can drag people through with so much more ease than in GoD.<br /><br />Anyway I don&#039;t think PoTime is needed for GoD by any means, but I&#039;d encourage having elemental gear for it. Then again you can get elemental quality gear in places too, but it&#039;s going to be really, really difficult.</div>
