					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Seems to me that EQ is really a contest of who can sit in a chair the longest each week rather than any real test of skill since I know we are not rocket scientists but just average folks.  The hardest challenge in the game is keeping folks motivated and signing on.</div><br /><br />I always keep thinking this, but people prove me wrong. Most of the FoT people raiding PoTime now could probably say something about their Quarm tactics. It&#039;s not hard by any means, but... This is not a diss at FoT btw, just a comment. We haven&#039;t done any content that the Forsaken people could comment on :P<br /><br /><br />Then again, what really is rocket science? I&#039;ve studied things that basically ARE rocket science, and they aren&#039;t that hard if you just spend the time studying it... Surprise surprise, it came down to &quot;sit in a chair the longest each week&quot;. Of course you&#039;re expected to have some basic brain functions going on, but if you fulfill that requirement, you&#039;re well on your way to doing well in anything you put your time in. EQ is in no way different from rocket science in this, except I guess you can still be useful in EQ with a minimal IQ.... but then again, the rocket scientists need coffee too :P</div>
