					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Forsaken&#039;s has had some leaders need a &#039;time-out&#039; to rest, and we don&#039;t know if they will ever recover and be back. We&#039;ve been going at it hard-core since we hit Time and it&#039;s been a great ride with some great people and I&#039;m glad I was a part of it. <br /><br />Leeandra is the drama queen. He posts in members forum that he&#039;s disbanding and apping elsewhere, after his forum status is removed he gets another member to post a &#039;proper (10page) goodbye&quot; with his plan to be superduper druid. I hope leeandra makes it to the #1 druid spot. Really. <br /><br />I want to thank you for all the big laughs you gave me all those times you used exedus on my group on accident right as we did a big pull, when I was on CH rotation. That was pretty funny and  how you&#039;d insist you didn&#039;t do it when you were the only one in the group with that ability. One time I remember you saying wrong page of hotkeys. :) Awww.. good times we&#039;ve had.<br /><br />Anyways.. take care. Be Super Duper Druid! Will hope to see you in the EQ Hall of Fame. *hugs*</div>
					<br />
