					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I can give some sympathy to Forsaken.  If FoT had lost 3 primary leaders, such as myself, kinladar, and fignutn all retiring/leaving/transfering.  While I have faith in FoT&#039;s ability to survive, if that had happened, FoT would of most likely have suffered far more crippling losses then we did.  <br /><br />But FoT only lost 1 officer and a small handful of people.  Which did slow us down some, but didn&#039;t stop us.  And with apps already finished and us flagging them up towards time.  It will fill in the gaps.  Ya they will need some gear, but FoT will continue on and will continue advancing.<br /><br />But we&#039;re still accepting a few more elementally/time flagged apps mainly in a few key areas such as clerics/rogues/wizards/bards.  And have a nice little bonus of dkp to go along with it.  So we might still snag a few more people from the server until reflagging is fully done.<br /><br />After that, Kinladar has great plans and great ideas for FoT&#039;s move into GoD.<br /><br />But I can understand how the loss of 3 leaders from FS can be causing them alot of casualties.  No guild would be totally immune to it.</div>
