					Post by: <b>Cloudskipper</b> on <b>April 30, 2004, 03:04:14 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Laylina $txt[176] April 29, 2004, 10:11:25 am</div><div class="quote">As you all sit there and laugh about how Rogosh&#039;s dream team is finally breaking up </div><br /><br />This kinda funny.....<br /><br />Forsaken was never Rogosh&#039;s &quot;Dream Team&quot; or his vision. Forsaken came along more by default than anything else, and it served throughout the years to be the dropping point of the high end games rejects. <br /><br />Don&#039;t get me wrong, Forsaken has some great people in it, but it was far from a dream come to fruition.<br /><br />Pretty much began the Summer of 2001......<br /><br />Highland Clan disbands....It&#039;s membship scattered and the majority fell into 3 guilds. Ascent, Hegemony (formed from the ashes), and Western Keep (also formed from the ashes).<br /><br />Kametupac couldn&#039;t really get Western Keep off the ground so Western Keep disbanded. <br /><br />Out of Western Keep 4 friends decided they wanted to stay guilded and decided to form a guild. So....Wedorf, Kerba, Cloudskipper, and Rogosh gathered some people and sat for a few hours in Dreadlands at the spires waiting for the GM to come. <br /><br />GM got the guild name incorrect at first....&quot;Foresaken&quot;. <br />While we were waiting the 4 of us were arguing over who was to be leader, because none of us wanted it. Rogosh got it in the end simply because he was the one who created the chat channel for the GM&#039;s to make the guild. <br /><br />Whatever happened in the years since really is a bit moot. Forsaken was formed by leftovers and rejects, led by a leader who didn&#039;t really want to lead, and pretty much stayed on that path. They accomplished much, and there is something to be said about that....but going so far as to call it a &quot;Dream Team&quot; is a bit excessive.<br /><br />Hell, Wedorf was caught selling Guild Bank on E-bay within a couple months.  ;D<br /><br /><br />Highland Clan is still the Greatest Rodcet Guild ever!</div>
