					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Kriyn $txt[176] May 03, 2004, 02:34:33 pm</div><div class="quote">     As far as I know, RoS is the only one out of the three that can still kill Xeg. Hegemony has not killed her yet and Conviction hasn&#039;t been able to do her again in a while.  I only keep up with RoS really in progress and they are close to killing Corn and Rathe as well.   <br /></div><br /><br />We have been farming the elemental planes for gear for the past few weeks.  We hit a elemental god here and there.  RZtW with 43 people was interesting on an off night.  And we got FR with 49 people.  Getting close on Coirnav.  Spawned him and killed 2/3 minis with plenty of time before we wiped.  Just started working on rathe.  I&#039;m sure having fun right now :)</div>
