					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Callon</b> on <b>July 07, 2004, 06:17:54 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">We have a few people talking about VT in Tul Acharn, but overall I don&#039;t think there&#039;s enough interest.&nbsp; It takes a huge, concentrated guild farming effort and people really have to want to go.&nbsp; We&#039;ll probably skip it and just keep working on PoP mobs.&nbsp; I&#039;d love to see a 2nd viable alternative to advancement besides elementals, but it doesn&#039;t exist right now.&nbsp; You need at least elemental geared tanks to do much of anything in GoD.&nbsp; Maybe OoW will offer another path.&nbsp; Nah, I doubt it.&nbsp; :badhairday:<br /><br />In PoP, TA/JH still needs the top 4 named to reach elems (Solusek Ro, RZ, MM, and Bert) plus Agnarr, Saryrn, and VZ.&nbsp; Saryrn will die soon after we finally finish the damn tower key.&nbsp; It&#039;s hard to get motivated to camp the orbs.&nbsp; /rude stupidly rare avatar spawn in Torment.&nbsp; VZ will fall the moment we can find the damn mob up.&nbsp; He&#039;s too easy and seems to get farmed.&nbsp; We need to work on Agnarr more, but he should be quite doable at our current level.&nbsp; We will probably start making Bert/MM attempts soon.<br /><br /></div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
