					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Honestly, I think it&#039;s rather noble that you back flag members, even if you are doing it for one person.</div><br /><br />Until that part where they normally don&#039;t let others tag and they&#039;re taking down flag mobs for 1 person.  So whole guilds can&#039;t get flagged because another guild starts earlier in the evening and takes down flag mobs for 1 person?  Nice.   :badhairday:  No wonder everything is dead most nights now.  <br /><br />I came to the conclusion last night that among those older guilds who were killing the same mobs we were a couple months ago, there is actually less demand for the pre-elem bosses.  Also some of the high end guilds are pretty well done with their backflagging after recruitment drives (Conviction, FoT, maybe others).  So there should be as much or more available.  The difference is Ruination came into being and yeah, if they&#039;re taking down flag targets for a really small number of people on a regular basis, that explains why nothing&#039;s up.  The others of us competing on these mobs have tagged some with each other so we don&#039;t have to do that.  <br /><br />*shrug* the spawn situation sucks.  Here&#039;s hoping Ruination adds &quot;elem flags required&quot; to their app requirements soon if they haven&#039;t already.</div>
