					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I love you guys in OA.. and TA ain&#039;t bad either.. but if you all are so concerned with only needing 2 kills for elementals.. it my be time to bag the 3 days a week thing and move on the mob when the mob is up.. and as far as flagging non guilded/apps thats an officers decision.. personally i&#039;d let ya in.. but I&#039;m not an officer. BTW Telun is a n00b&nbsp; 8)</div>
