					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Domaris</b> on <b>July 20, 2004, 05:03:55 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">We aren&#039;t racing - its just one member I know of for sure who is in the military and needed a few flags we did while he was not able to log in. And you know I love ya Incy - I just thought that was bad form personally, but that stuff happens. Alot of the guilds out there workign towards elementals help eachother out by allowing members from other guilds to tag along if they are missing something we are doing, I know we do it all the time and have had some tag along with others when they were missing something we had already done. It of course is a per guild situation, but we had let some apps tag along with us - would have expected the common courtesy of returning the favor...is all I meant. </div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Callon</b> on <b>July 20, 2004, 06:50:54 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">We raid more than 3 days a week and need several mobs to hit elems.&nbsp; But because of our jobs, families, etc. we don&#039;t start raiding until around 8-9pm est most nights.&nbsp; I don&#039;t want a discussion about &quot;we have lives too&quot;, etc. etc.&nbsp; I&#039;m not saying ya don&#039;t.&nbsp; Just think of it as our time zone.&nbsp; That&#039;s when most people can get on.&nbsp; Guilds like Ruination start earlier, so they get the targets.&nbsp; That in my opinion is poor game design. It&#039;s also the way EQ has always been, though it doesn&#039;t make it any better.<br /><br />But yeah, like OA we try to work with guilds doing this content to get and allow tagging and just generally be on good terms with people.&nbsp; If your guild only needs a couple flags, maybe doesn&#039;t even care about the loot, etc., and you&#039;re repeatedly ganking mobs that most of our guild needs and not allowing tags, it shouldn&#039;t be hard to see why that blows from our perspective.&nbsp; Just saying raid earlier doesn&#039;t do it for us.&nbsp; We&#039;re not on at 5pm est or something.&nbsp; We&#039;re just not and we won&#039;t be most days.&nbsp; That&#039;s life.&nbsp;  It would be nice though if you&#039;d just encourage your members to tag with another guild when only a couple of them need a flag. Not counting on it though, especially if you don&#039;t allow other guilds to tag with you.&nbsp; Then who would let ya?&nbsp;  <br /><br />So, hopefully Ruination&#039;s tolerance for continued backflagging is low and they won&#039;t have any reason left at all to kill this &#039;junk&#039; much longer.&nbsp; We can&#039;t log on a raid force at all hours to get targets &quot;when they&#039;re up&quot; and we can&#039;t compete with a hardcore raid guild, nor do we want to. <br /><br />-- Callon / Tul Acharn</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Deathboo</b> on <b>July 20, 2004, 10:27:17 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">i would just like to say that yes we are a hard core raiding guild and we have an ap process and like any other ele guild we did back flags to get our apps flagged.<br /><br />and if i rember corectly we helped Tul Acharn&nbsp; kill rydda dar then let thier guild members tag alot with us for the other trials<br /><br />snd of course with us being ele flaged we are going to kill mobs when they are up to gear our guild members and apps to be ready for potime its not our fault if you raid later and you cant expect us to work our raids around your guilds raid times<br /><br />and in the beginning we did allow people to join us for flags but then it got to the point were people started trying to invite all thier friends and soon non apps or tagged members were getting flags before our own apps and members di so we simply made the rule no more<br /><br />and you can try to throw forsakens old rep on us but the fact remain we are not forsaken we are ruination <br /><br />and from another stand point i personally dont belive in helping other guilds get to ele plains ifeel its something they should earn we all had to now take apoth for example UOP helped them kill rz and the next day thier under geared members were in earth turning the zone into bot so honestly untill we hit time i like how elemental plains are now</div>
					<br />
