					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Corolinth</b> on <b>August 12, 2004, 01:26:40 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Callon $txt[176] August 10, 2004, 12:30:02 pm</div><div class="quote">btw, I think Brews seem to advance slowly mainly because they did the VT thing, which is cool.&nbsp; They&#039;ve explained more than once that that&#039;s just what they wanted to do as a guild, regardless of how others measure progression.&nbsp; So good for them.</div><br /><br />Actually, VT is a good move. By going to Vex Thal you get your entire raid force geared up. Most of that loot is on par with drops off of the minis in Sol Ro&#039;s tower (except VT loot has higher AC on it). Where VT slows you down is that alot of guilds hang around longer than they should.</div>
