					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Kinladar</b> on <b>August 26, 2004, 08:59:48 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I would tend to categorize Fires now focused on GoD with Time just a once a week farm zone. It&#039;s like VT was when PoP came out, just a really good place to get the whole guild geared, and quickly. 40 drops average per night, with little rot is a sign we&#039;ll keep doing it for a while yet. I think the only things to rot so far have been some of the class specific items, the Bard Sword from Inny has rotted a few times, that Mag only mask a few times also. God damned Rallos needs to start coughin up more DBoTW though. Killed his dumb ass like 30 times, and only 3 drops.<br /><br />Also considering we can get past the Twins in Uqua now, we are close to Qvic. Just need to refine a bit is all.<br /><br />I think I like Ikkinz 4 raid, Antechamber though, more than any of the others, at least when you down the big mofo, you get 4 really nice things at a minimum. And if you watch what you&#039;re doing, (with a dash of Luck) it&#039;s only a 2 hour raid max. I doubt we&#039;ll put Uqua on farm status though.... that&#039;s a real pain. <br /><br />So to categorize things:<br /><br />GoD Content (IE All have killed all of Time):<br />(1) Dol/EiE<br />(2) Ascent<br />(3) Fires of Time<br /><br />PoP Content: (Still have to Finish Time, IE Kill all through Quarm)<br />(4) Conviction<br />(5) Reign of Swords<br />(6) Hegemony<br />(7) Ruination<br />(8) Apothesis <br />(9) Union of Power<br />(10) Asian Alliance (Really have no idea where they are, but they rank somewhere, since they regularly farm rings in earth, and fire mobs)</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
