					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Kinladar $txt[176] August 26, 2004, 08:59:48 am</div><div class="quote">I think I like Ikkinz 4 raid, Antechamber though, more than any of the others, at least when you down the big mofo, you get 4 really nice things at a minimum. And if you watch what you&#039;re doing, (with a dash of Luck) it&#039;s only a 2 hour raid max. I doubt we&#039;ll put Uqua on farm status though.... that&#039;s a real pain.</div><br /><br />Uqua really isn&#039;t so bad in hindsight. After our last run for reflagging when we fucked up and managed to get 8-9 mobs in camp at once, I really don&#039;t hate Uqua. It was like our Fairy Godmother showed up and waved around the Wand of Pwn. Then suddenly, Uqua didn&#039;t suck anymore.</div>
