					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">The new games are hitting all the guilds, as was expected.<br /><br />We&#039;ve hit a little stumble the last week or so, but I would not put FoT above Ascent at this time, there&#039;s still about a dozen or so people in Ascent who made it through some Tvexu content still in there.<br /><br />We&#039;re just sorting out who went to what new game etc... Some are playing EQ2 for the next couple weeks to see what that is like, but have cut back raid times some to do so.<br /><br />We&#039;re accepting apps, as any guild at this time that expects to survive beyond the new games releases are. <br /><br />Will be interesting when WoW goes live.</div>
