					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">#1 They do still exist, but I suppose your implying that they are not either your new recruit/hazing guild or that the people in it do not amass to anything that you consider apart of your raidforce.<br /><br />#2 I do not mean for people to take numbers alone, however, people who show up to raids do help.&nbsp; <br /><br />#3 I apologize I thought most people were registered by now on eqrankings.&nbsp; <br /><br /><br />Zorlo, are you registered on eqrankings?&nbsp; #1026406?<br /><br />Simply, just meant for him or anyone else who desires to take a gander at the names, what Ascent is killing and then try and see what FoT is doing, it becomes clearer is all.&nbsp; Then again someone could say this was all made up, depending on if it suited their needs...<br /><br />Don&#039;t mistake this for one moment, I do not dislike FoT any more or less than I dislike Ascent, so this is pretty unbiased as it gets.<br /><br /><br />Top 4 of leading edge of content.<br /><br />1. EiE<br />2. DA<br />3. Ascent<br />4. FoT<br /><br />RN Top of all time.<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Avatars of Discord<br />2.&nbsp; Ascent<br />3.&nbsp; Altered Destiny<br />4.&nbsp; EiE<br />5.&nbsp; Eastern Keep<br />6.&nbsp; DA<br />7.&nbsp; FoT<br />8.&nbsp; Harbingers of Storms<br />9.&nbsp; Arcane Legacy<br />10.&nbsp; Dragon Knight<br />11.&nbsp; Mythmakers<br />12.&nbsp; Dragon Force<br />13.&nbsp; Conviction<br />14.&nbsp; Reign of Swords<br />15.&nbsp; Exiled Legion<br />16.&nbsp; Ancient Souls<br />17.&nbsp; Axiom Shift<br />18.&nbsp; Forsaken&nbsp; <br />19.&nbsp; Union of Power<br />20.&nbsp; Circle of Sol<br /><br />Not looking to start shit, but this is what I consider it all to be about, ALL TIME baby.&nbsp; I said this a long time ago, some changes were made ofcourse.</div>
