					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Kinladar $txt[176] August 29, 2003, 10:33:50 am</div><div class="quote">Kinda hoping this can be a more civilized discussion than the VN one... my hopes are probably too much, but we&#039;ll see.<br /><br />My personal point of view is:<br /><br />1) Ascent<br />2) EiE/DA<br />3) Arirang<br />4) FoT<br />5) Forsaken<br />6) Reign of Swords (One kill from Elementals)<br />7) Union of Power (Killed Emp Ssra)<br />8-9) Hegemony - Menacing Visage<br />10) Not really sure... so many that could fit here, that I&#039;ll have to think some more<br /><br />The top 2 are very clear, they&#039;re in Plane of Time, so that is easy. Ascent Killed Quarn as well.<br /><br />After that, the lines become a bit more blurred, at least I think they have in the last few months.<br /><br />In the last 3 months, Arirang has been kinda quiet, though it looks like they are working on Xegony, so since they&#039;ve killed Fennin, that gives them a bit of a leg on FoT on Elemental god progress.<br /><br />FoT has kinda went a bit of a different direction, since Fennin was getting ganked real fast every time they  looked for him, they worked out getting to Xegony Isle, interesting fight, but I can see them beating that one fairly soon I think. Right now, I think they could do Fennin once we catch him. <br /><br />Forsaken has made some astounding progress, and much as it may pain anyone to admit, they will probably continue to progress, but at what rate has yet to be seen. There are rumors of some encounters getting gimped, namely Rallos Zek (again). I think SoE has changed the Rallos Zek encounter so many times, it&#039;s crazy.<br /><br />So again, top 2 are simple answers, beyond that... well, there&#039;s only a fine line between Arirang and FoT atm, with Forsaken getting a streak of kills the last few weeks. <br /><br />I think Forsaken will have to turn Farm mode on much as Arirang and FoT have to be able to attempt the Elemental gods. That takes time with the lower number of drops in Elementals compared to a place like VT, and the stiff competition with 2 other guilds already there.<br /><br /></div><br /><br />How times have changed to -<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Rednight $txt[176] January 08, 2005, 04:35:48 pm</div><div class="quote">1) DA &amp; EiE (OoW/RS Farm + GoD)<br />2) Ascent (2 PG raids from Anguish)<br />3) Conviction (GoD - Uqua)<br />4) Reign of Swords (Time Farm / Ikk trials)<br />5) UoP (Fenin Ro Kill / PoEb Access)<br />6) OA (Avatars/PoE Rings/PoW Minis)<br />7) IL (Full Elemental Access)<br />8 )BM(Solro Minis)<br />9) Dawning Nemisis(3 Kills from Elemental)<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div></div>
