					Post by: <b>malibu66</b> on <b>January 27, 2005, 05:16:15 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Heya Callon!<br /><br />This is Eihctir fom TA. The TA/JH/DF alliance is still around, but we haven&#039;t raided anything in weeks. We took a few groups into Sol Ro after the new flag quest was added, but that has been it.<br /><br />Sons of Kings has been around - not sure what they are doing anymore, but they were breaking into the Tier 1 mobs a while back.<br /><br />I believe the gaps will get worse. The new backflag rules have allowed the already Time flagged guilds to pull apps through 8 at a time, while the pre-Time guilds struggle with Tier 4 bosses and keeping members. This may settle down for a bit as I belive RoS and Conviction are full to the gills.</div>
					<br />
