					Post by: <b>Toastie</b> on <b>February 03, 2005, 05:14:14 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">At a time when guilds are folding fairly quickly, the mere fact that some guilds are able to hold a raid force together, and complete new content is something special.&nbsp; Congratulations to any guild who is making forward progression these days, whether its DA/EiE, Conviction, RoS, Inner Loop, Brewmasters, League of Sozobon or any other guild.&nbsp; You&#039;ve survived where many others have fallen.</div><br />I’ll give you this to an extent... however, two things.<br /><br />1) Everquest, like it or not is a game about progression, the only reason to play is to <br />I’ll give you this to an extent... however, two things.<br /><br />1) Everquest, like it or not is a game about progression, the only reason to play is to progress, so to say its something special in its self that a guild is still progressing is silly.<br /><br />2) I could give two shits and a fuck less about conviction, da/eie or whoever, where their progression is etc.&nbsp; If you’re having fun playing EQ, doing whatever content you enjoy, then I’m happy for you.&nbsp; <br /><br />But...when you say shit like <br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote"> Cynosure and Kelekdrix down to Conviction on our very first attempts! More to come~<br /><br />/poke Grem</div><br /><br />Its fucking retarded, for a few reasons...<br /><br />Grem, is and was a member of ascent.&nbsp; And by saying /poke grem, to me your essentially saying /poke ascent.&nbsp; I’ve never been in ascent, but I have a lot of friends who have been in the past.<br /><br />Now, your all gloating that you killed kelekdrix and cynosure.... cong you...<br /><br />But to be gloating to someone from Ascent, <i>who did that content when it was new</i> and by all accounts, when they did it where undisputedly one of the top 5 guilds in all of everquest, is plain ignorance.&nbsp; <br /><br />Sure, ascent has had its difficulties as of late, but any guild that has a substantial player base leave (i know from personal experience)&nbsp; is going to suffer the same fate.&nbsp; and the fact that your doing it <b>almost a year later</b> and gloating about it is retarded, and makes you sound like a total dickmitten, regardless of ascent&#039;s recent decline over the last few months.<br /><br /><br />p.s.&nbsp; who the fuck is mgram and why do i care what you think about me?</div>
