					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">IL made there first attempt at Xeg last night.&nbsp;  wow,<br /><br />Being many of our first times, i think alot of us, including me, didnt know what to expect, as we saw a group of 5 mobs, competly ignore us and head straight for Xeg&#039;s agro list.&nbsp; I mean, we were told what would happen, but still didnt expect it when it happened.&nbsp; Think first time we got her down to 95% or so, i know they tried again, but i had to log.<br /><br />For the first time, i know i learned alot about the encounter.&nbsp; And im sure we will do much better next go round, having only one ench online at the time really hurt as i could tell.&nbsp; I think that was the deciding factor having only the one ench.<br /><br />Its amazing how much harder the encounter with Xeg is than FR.&nbsp;  The adds got us this time, and again i know they tried again, and hell they might have fun, but i do not know.</div>
