					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Nah, Rondo should be two groupable if you had Tacvi/Anguish gear. A tank at that level&#039;s gonna have maxed shielding, stick in enough rogues for DPS around it, a good chanter or two for controlling the mezzable adds, and a couple paladins for off tanking the two that aren&#039;t mezzable, and it&#039;d be two groupable. I&#039;d think a solid 3-4 clerics could keep your tank up. I can see it.<br /><br />People said the same thing about Solusek Ro to, and Ascent two grouped that before GoD came out. <br /><br />Don&#039;t underestimate what skill can do.</div>
