					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Fr and Smith should be 2 groupable by people with Anguish/Tacvi gear. Take people from CestusDei for example. If you look at most of that guilds magelos you will see why it should be easy. Clerics with over 9500hps and over 10k mana unbuffed should have no problem keeping up a tank unbuffed at 14.5k with max shielding and spell shielding. <br /><br />Two clerics of that gear lvl with one tank of that gear lvl would have no problem with FR. Also the Rogues and Rangers your lookin at would be 11k Unbuffed with rogues havein 28 damage daggers so easyly doing over 1000 dps with disc. They are probly also going to resist the ae mostly if not all the time so can stay in the whole fight at max Range, FR would be a cake walk. Smith, they would have to burn down Weaponmaster fast but then Rhondo himself only has about 100k or 150k hps so even tho he quads for 3k he would go down really fast even without disc. </div>
