					Post by: <b>A Mammal</b> on <b>February 10, 2005, 06:34:06 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">First off I didnt know we were saying that 2 groups from this server could do it. Im sure there are 2 groups on this server that can, but I must admit the toons from Veeshan would have a easyer time doing it. <br /><br />Secondly FR&#039;s rampage is AE and is limited to a distance, which is why I said max melee and the rogues could stay on him threw the fight. Clerics will stay out of the AE Ramp and the AE spell and still be able to CH. As Kila said they should be able to CH almost forever on a horse with VoQ or higher + clicks. A tank like Phad or Chubz or Zilkorrn should be able to stay up pretty easy and also never lose agro to anything. Personally If I was going to do this assumeing everyone would just go along and do it lol. I would take Phad, Chubz, Shib, Reyem, Anabesi, Koradur, Justyse, Fletchera, Averiel, Ferriciean, Trellitius, and Tilien. Will they ever get together and do it? Id say no, lol. Could it be done by them? Yes, I think they could 2 group FR and Smith without a problem. Thats strickly off EQrankings random people that have high hp good dps, high resist, and etc. You could change that around and put in Wizards or Necros or Mages where the rogues and ranger are and it would still work, and probly be easyer. </div>
