					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I&#039;m 100% positive I could two-group Feninn with only Conviction people.&nbsp; He&#039;s just not that hard.&nbsp; Max hit is 1962 btw, according to my source.&nbsp; That&#039;s cake.&nbsp; Celestius Dei folks could one group him I would bet, maybe 7 peolpe.&nbsp; <br /><br />Nobody is going to do it though, because it would take for freaking ever to get through all the mobs before him in the script with two groups, and his loot sucks now.&nbsp; <br /><br />Mudflation is all there is to it - with each expansion stuff gets easier.&nbsp; These days Trakanon takes me about 25% mana to solo, pet never drops below 80% hps.&nbsp; It&#039;s cake.&nbsp; I&#039;ve almost solo&#039;d Zlandicar (11%...).&nbsp; Classes who can heal or slow have it easier than I, and I&#039;m sure can solo alot harder stuff.&nbsp; Uber gear really does make a difference.</div>
