int of recent responses to we killed it faster, we killed it with fewer people, fewer attempts, we&#039;re farming X, etc.  It&#039;s just nitpicking.  We had that discussion last week.  Be proud of your guild moving forward.  But the only objective measure in the great pissing contest that the top ten list has always been is what progression mobs you&#039;ve killed, not how fast your current rate of progression is.  You have not killed any elemental gods yet.  You may do so soon, but it hasn&#039;t happened yet, so no one here is going to rank you as high as those who have.  Your talk about how killing FR/Xeg is no big deal is just that right now, talk.  Do it.  You&#039;ll get your credit then, if that really matters anyway.  I would think being proud of how your guild improves over time is far more important than getting kudos from other people on the server.  <br /><br />Ah... Moraganna...<div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">seems more like a bunch of cock waving contest then anything else. </div><br /><br />Welcome to the thread.   8)  It&#039;s been like this for years.  It just wouldn&#039;t have that top ten thread drama without lots of gratuitous cock waving!  <br /><br />And Kinladar just said my sentiments with a lot fewer words.  </div>
