e.&nbsp; Anyways, my point is that you left while the guild was still in it&#039;s infancy, and not only are your claims completely lacking any substance (the facts are quite straight), but you are simply trying to bait Justyse into a flame war.&nbsp; I&#039;ve noticed you have been attempting to pointedly antagonize Conviction members and officers on a few occasions now, and from reading your PMs on our forum this seems to be something you get a kick out of doing on a regular basis, and what caused everyone to get so pissed off at you in the first place (the &quot;trauma&quot; you are referring to, I&#039;m sure).<br /><br />In summery, stop being a troll.</div>
