					Post by: <b>Zorlo</b> on <b>February 17, 2005, 04:19:48 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Rylden, what the fuck are you talking about?<br /><br />Your post does nothing to make you look intelligent as you had hoped, it makes you look like an idiot. The best part is, how ironic it all is, the fact that you desparage those who spell incorrectly online, and do it yourself. Or the fact that you insult those who &quot;sit in front of their computers all day&quot; when you clearly took a few days out of your life to draft a response to them. If you dont give a fuck like you claim so nonsensically, why do you post at all?<br /><br />Also, congratulations on your grandiloquence. I find it amusing that you got so captivated with impressing us with your misuse of uncommonly esoteric words, that you forgot what you were trying to say. And that is giving you the benefit of the doubt that you even knew what you were trying to say. <br /><br />Your post makes zero sense. Had you spent 5 seconds trying to word your thoughts more carefully, instead of merely packing them with as many synonyms as you could, perhaps you would have accomplished more then embarassing yourself. <br /><br />the best part, <br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Second, soap and water are things that have been around for centuries.&nbsp; I know you&#039;ve heard some terrible things about them, particularly what involves drenching yourself in dihydrogen monoxide, but your cares will be washed away!&nbsp; Soon, you will cause flowers to wilt and dogs to vomit less often because the stench you exude will be tolerable.</div><br /><br />What the fuck are you talking about? Jesus, you make zero sense. No one is impressed with your ability to name water as its proper covalent molecule. Congratulations. But what relevance does washing yourself, have with an everquest discussion on guild hierarchy? The same amount of relevance your post in general commands.<br /><br />Equally amazing is the fact that you would try to condemn those who play this game as not having social lives? Surely you assume the average reader of this forum is as retarded as you claim. You are an officer in conviction, the second best guild on the server. Youve clearly invested as much effort into this game as the average person, but really more. <br /><br />I find it ironic that you would attempt to mock those who share the same habits as you, claiming you are more intelligent, through your pretentious diction. Perhaps you ought to consider next time, that no one is impressed by your arrogant misuse of SAT vocabulary, or that by insulting the group of people you readily associate with in game, you merely insult yourself</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Rylden</b> on <b>February 17, 2005, 04:25:34 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Well, here&#039;s a spin for you... if you noticed it had a tinge of veracity to it, you&#039;d be right.  As all true writers will tell you, write about what you know.  8)  But thank you, Zorlo, for your kind words and criticism.  I never intended it to be anything other than mere farce, and apparently, I hit a nerve.  I do apologize if I demeaned you or anyone you know.  Actually, I don&#039;t really apologize as much as just shrug in your general direction.<br /><br />Now, where were we?&nbsp; Oh yes... top ten guilds.<div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Dwalion SoulVoid $txt[176] February 17, 2005, 12:33:20 pm</div><div class="quote">Also, from folks who care, everyone knows that EiE and DA are an alliance, however, I rank them separate cause I personally feel that each guild could hold their own as a single entity.&nbsp; Comments?</div><br /><br />While it may be the truth that the could hold their own as a single entity, there are very few individuals on the server that would actually qualify them as such.&nbsp; People don&#039;t say EiE did this or DA did that... they say DA/EiE accomplished this.&nbsp; It&#039;s more than an accepted alliance on RN, it&#039;s a solid team of One major force.<br /><br />I guess the question that should be asked is this: Due to recent instability in server population, could either guild achieve the exact same content without the other... That is... could Dol Amroth complete all six MPG trials without ANY EiE members involved and vice versa?&nbsp; I&#039;m just curious.</div>
					<br />
