					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Well, I must say that I find this to be very amusing. Two(2) top-notch, A-class writers sparring on the rodcetnife.org boards is something you dont see every day. Through their use of extraordinarily large, albeit un-needed, words they&#039;ve both proven that they:<br />A. Have nothing better to do with their time. <br />B. Envy Callon&#039;s Penis(yes, it is to be capitalized)<br />C. Obviously, are some what nerdy due to the fact they use words such as, dihydrogen monoxide. <br />D. Think that no one here bathes. <br /><br />So, back to talking about top ten guilds. I think no one doubts the ability of DA/EiE to survive on their own should the alliance split. However, as long as the alliance exists it&#039;s only fair to label them as one(1) spot on the top ten list. They did not accomplish their feats on their own, they were allied. When Tul-Acharn and Junn Horde were allied, all of their kills were linked with the alliance, not one(1) single guild. While they would certainly be able to survive on their own, they would not progress through content nearly as fast. They need each other, plain and simple. <br /><br /> :wiggle:<br /><br />-Red-<br /><br />Oh, by the way, I used one(1) just to annoy people reading this post. :) Cherrio!<br /></div>
