					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Rodcettruthbringer $txt[176] February 20, 2005, 04:54:06 am</div><div class="quote">Humm  ok as I  recall you <b>QUIT </b> EQ and ran to WOW with the Real Officers of conviction of old, The ones That was the backbone of it. you even had your account up for sale, So How Can you say you never left them?  Only reason you came back and was made leader was Ysab. she just wanted out and you was only one there that was a officer for any amount of time. <br /></div><br />Why do you care so much? Were you not made guild leader and are still crying about it?<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Rodcettruthbringer $txt[176] February 20, 2005, 04:54:06 am</div><div class="quote">Haha  Lets do a experment. Replace thoese Officers with Monkeys, I am shure you would boost the wisdom and Int.  of your officers.<br /></div><br />Hey look, supidity! So, you didn&#039;t make officer either....... there, there, it&#039;s ok.<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Rodcettruthbringer $txt[176] February 20, 2005, 04:54:06 am</div><div class="quote">Yea the officers  have made it easyer to kick people out who says anything different than what the officers thinks. I am Suprised they have not kicked me out yet. but i am about to start playing again and quit and join a real guild that Earns there way and don&#039;t stand on what others befor them have done.<br /></div><br />So, you are a current member of Conviction, yet you have quit playing but are still guilded? Showing your loyalty you come to this board under the auspices of telling the truth and talk shit. I wish you would stay in Conviction, you have just the qualities we are looking for.... /snicker.<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Rodcettruthbringer $txt[176] February 20, 2005, 04:54:06 am</div><div class="quote">      Conviction Was once one of the Best guilds on the server But when the core officers that did get them to where they are left and made the paper officers, it has went to the dogs. They are just another Forsaken or Acent now only a shell of what they use to be and what they could of been. it is ashamed to see yet another guild that should of ended at there peek.<br /></div><br />Forsaken and Ascent died as a guild, and really stopped progressing once their core left... Conviction has progressed through content after the old officers left. There is no comparison. You can&#039;t argue your point. I hope one of the monkeys, erm officers, in Conviction approaches Kinladar for your IP address, does the comparison on the Conviction boards, and unmasks your uneducated persona. I am sure that most of the guilds on Rodcet would welcome such a stand up character who wants to earn their way and not stand on what others have done before them..... incidentally, that would mean DA or EiE.... I&#039;m sure they are going to love your attitude. <br /><br />Good luck, strange, stupid, masked moron.<br /></div>
