					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Humm  ok as I  recall you QUIT EQ and ran to WOW with the Real Officers of conviction of old, The ones That was the backbone of it. you even had your account up for sale, So How Can you say you never left them?  Only reason you came back and was made leader was Ysab. she just wanted out and you was only one there that was a officer for any amount of time. <br /></div><br />Ok let me poke holes in your story here, cuz its so fun. And because youre a retard so its easy.<br /><br />First yes i quit EQ... for <b>3 weeks</b> retard. Because the officers refused to log on, refused to do any work, refused to help in almost any way what so ever, because they were burned out, I dont blame them...and it burned me out. I came back with the promise that things would be different, and they are.<br />And i didnt go to WoW, never played WoW beta, and never bought it...again youre a retard.<br />I played EQ2 beta, but never bought the game. Shows how much you know...retard.<br />When did I say I never left? I simply said I was still here, which I am...again, youre a retard.<br />I was made leader far before Ysa &quot;left&quot;, we just did it quietly because there was a whole lot of emotions still left fragile from when Diss left. Guild leadership was finally passed about a month after Ysa quietly took her leave. It was her wish to not make the guild upset once more. Because she cared about the guild. <br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">I am Suprised they have not kicked me out yet. but i am about to start playing again</div><br />Now this part will be both fun and amusing for myself and the officers.<br />Are you positive that you havent already been kicked out? :) And most of all.. do you think we care? If you havent been on, if you havent been playing, if you abandoned the guild when we did all the work we&#039;ve done in the past couple of months...do you think we give a flying shit if you even exist? I can answer that for you. No, we don&#039;t. <div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Yea the officers  have made it easyer to kick people out who says anything different than what the officers thinks</div><br />First, your grasp of the english language is astounding. /bravo<br />Second, for your information and anyone else that gives a flying shit. The policies that allow the officers to remove people have been in place for months. Diss specifically set up rules to allow us to degulid people that had not logged on for certain periods of time, or those that were simply retards... like you :) Maybe if you read the board once in a while, you would know these rules, but I guess reading is a little too much to ask from someone of your intellectual magnitude.<br /><br />Oh or maybe this had something to do with the mass email all members got yesterday, Aww how sweet, did you get all upset? heres a tissue.<br /><br />I&#039;m sure Dalla will have tons of fun with you.. Good luck with that  :)<br /> <br />Oh yeah...<br />Youre a pussy  8)<br />Please post more drivel, I think my pirate likes it.<br /><br /></div>
