					Post by: <b>Dose</b> on <b>February 21, 2005, 04:00:14 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Rodcettruthbringer $txt[176] February 21, 2005, 01:36:08 am</div><div class="quote">3. ROS      Same as EIE/DA does there thing and moves on Friendly people and would app. to them if i got back into the game full time.  They should be in #2 Spot<br /><br />4. UOP      Family guild that takes to long to advance and thinks it is the way to go like Clearing  VT Way to many times, If they went to pop instead they woudl be futher up on the list. <br /><br />5. IL        LOL this one Prodigy said it all.   Defently should be alot lower on the list if on list at all. If you cant do something on your own then you do not beling where you are.<br /></div><br /><br />I love a person with an agenda, after all, I am one myself. At first, I only wanted to share in the amusement of this thread, but now, I feel I owe it to this thread a meager chance at payback, so here goes...<br /><br />RoS is #3.  To say that they should be in the #2 spot is a rather insulting thing to say about their guild, imho. They are progressing well thru GoD, and are farming Time. They have <i>yet</i> to reach Qvic. Since it has become rather casual for us* to clear Qvic, I&#039;m gonna just go ahead and say that in that respect, we are ahead of them. They&#039;re a fine bunch, and I personally have never had beef with them.<br /><br />*&lt;Conviction&gt; (Don&#039;t want to confuse you)<br /><br />UoP has been moving thru the PoP expansion for quite some time. They moved from VT when they chose. I&#039;m guessing since they didn&#039;t ask for your advice then, that they don&#039;t want it now.<br /><br />IL is progressing as a guild. They&#039;ve been around a long, long, time. They&#039;ll be around, and progressing, after you have long since left WoW, and moved on to another game to troll the boards of.<br /><br />The list in and of itself is only a reflection of people who choose to play everquest, today. Bands of comrades, sharing in spoils. You, of your own free will and accord, present yourself as someone whose opinion matters, the self-acclaimed Alan Greenspan of life on the Nife. Keep on talking it up E.F. Hutton, but nobody is listening. <br /><br />Perhaps if I gave myself the title:<br /><br />Thesuperdeeduperhappymagicknowingalltruthtellerofrodcetnife<br /><br />my post would gain more merit?<br /><br />hmm, now to create an online email account, and get that as my login...<br /><br />Oh yes... :soap:<br /><br />The truth shall be known.<br />( In superdeeduperhappymagic style!)<br /><br />...hmm, maybe not.<br /><br />For now:<br /><br /><span style="font-size: 14pt;"><i>This message has been brought to you by ~</i></span></div>
