					Post by: <b>Karshak</b> on <b>February 22, 2005, 02:10:53 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Lets face it, no one really cares about the top 10 guilds list today.... all the banter between those who left on a high/low and those that play through highs/lows is just a filler until Plinko gets online and responds. :)<br /><br />On that note, I respect the fact that Ascent and FoT were guilds 2 and 3 but Conviction is currently #2. It&#039;s the &quot;What have you done for me lately&quot; versus the &quot;What have you done for me in the past&quot; situation. It&#039;s not personal. :P<br /><br />Yes, Conviction has it easier without the racing, the extra levels, the apps from defunct guilds... but we are still here, and we continue to progress. When we get 5 PG raid trials under our belt we can all come together and have a ticker tape parade but until that time how about we just chill..... p<br /><br /></div>
