					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">My apologizes for inticing a flame war unseen for monthes on Rodcet Nife.&nbsp; It has revived some people who have been dorment and been in the need of a &quot;quick&quot; fix. I can assure you that it was not the original intent of my post.&nbsp; Although I&#039;m sure a few people enjoyed every minute of it even though they say they hate drama.&nbsp; Even though the flames was not all centered around my post, it was directly or indirectly related to the next 20 pages of it.<br />I am not apologizing for &quot;my&quot; opinions, just the flaming it has caused, and will more than likely continue unfortunately.&nbsp; <br /><br />It&#039;s pretty much a mute point on guild progression.&nbsp; People believe one thing, others, of course, believe in something else, but it&#039;s no reason for personal attacks and/or name calling.&nbsp; This is a game.&nbsp; It&#039;s like highschool, when you leave nobody will care who you are or what you did.&nbsp; Of course you make friends and enemies but in the bigger scheme of things it&#039;s still just a game.&nbsp; So enjoy it.&nbsp;  8) <br /><br />Diss.&nbsp; Plinko did not flame conviction.&nbsp; He made comments on the officers and that was it.&nbsp; He even showed respect for the old conviction officers such as yourself.&nbsp; Why he posted under a false name? /shrug.&nbsp; Does it matter? To some people yes. <br /><br />I love Justyse, but hate Tiiden.&nbsp; That of course if just my opinion.&nbsp; Does it matter that I hate Tiiden? no.&nbsp; He probably feels the same about me, but again it&#039;s just a game.&nbsp; I&#039;m sure sooner or later we will come to an understanding and all will be well.<br /><br />So again.&nbsp; My apologies on inciting this.&nbsp; Wasn&#039;t my intention, just got out of hand.&nbsp; Tempers showed their ugly face and everything after was downhill.&nbsp; <br /><br />Lets squash it and move on.&nbsp; Gratz to all guilds on their recent kills.&nbsp; <br />Redora I dont&#039; handle applicants.&nbsp; So no.&nbsp; I didn&#039;t offer you a guild tag right out of the blue.</div>
