					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Nice attempt at saving face Prodigy.  Too bad not everyone is as stupid as Plinko or else we really would have Fallen for it.  Did you see what I did there?<br /><br />Anyway, congratulations on respecting the old officers of Conviction.  Go you.  I find it odd, however, that the old officers of Conviction, <br />a) let you in the guild and <br />b) didn&#039;t progress to where Conviction is today <br />c) all ran away when things got tough to either sell their old characters for obscene cash (without having any problems making sure they were geared up as much as possible first, including a brand new beautiful 1.5 epic to raise the value) <br />and /or <br />d) ran off to create a brand NEW guild, whose sole purpose was to bad mouth Conviction, it&#039;s new officers, members, progression, and try to steal the applicants because the guild leader just [I]happened[/I] to have access to all new applications.<br /><br />Well, I dare say, had it not been for all you other mother fuckers, Conviciton of NOW would not have had to spend the money to get brand new servers, new boards, new websites, new EVERYTHING because of the allegeded [I]caliber[/I] of you [I]old timers[/I]<br /><br />Well, wake up, sweethearts, because a brand new Conviction is here.  WE believe in doing the right thing.  WE believe in progressing despite the odds.  WE believe in standing for WHAT we believe in without making faux names on the boards.  Hell, apparently, WE believe in a hell of a lot more than any of you old timers.<br /><br />I&#039;m so glad you left... each and every one of you... because we&#039;d still be stuck in PoP content kissing your asses just because you thought you were better somehow cause you had an O or L next to your name.<br /><br />I&#039;d take just ONE of the current officers over your old time core ANY day, and actually, if I HAD to pick one.. .I can guarantee you that Tiiden would be at the top of that list.<br /><br />WE made it to Qvic.  YOU didn&#039;t.  WE beat the keeper.  YOU ran off to form a new guild.  WE took out Uqua, and in fact beat the twins our very first time there.  YOU used a guild that was falling apart to make your toons be all that and then sell them or form some pathetic group called Yawning Nimrods.<br /><br />You old timers didn&#039;t have the FIRST CLUE what Conviction was about, what it stood for, or for what we were capable.  We&#039;re right on the verge of progressing farther than any of you dreamed... and we did it WITHOUT YOU.<br /><br />So go back to your little PoP guild, WoW, EQ2, or RL... whatever you decided to do... We&#039;re getting along JUST fine.</div>
