					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">What is this crap I am reading?<br /><br /><br />First, Laylina, your posts make you more shallow than ever, you have came here and posted drama before and now since you wear an Echoes tag, you are something different?&nbsp; I am shocked after you had that major whine posting here EiE let you in, but that is what it does take to progress, right?<br /><br />You are posting how your guilds (EiE/DA) do not come here and post accomplishments?&nbsp; In the same breathe you comment on how you guys have had 7 or 8 server firsts in the past month?&nbsp; Right, sure, just some examples....&nbsp; I know in the past, folks from either guild have posted on the guild&#039;s accomplishments... which there is NOTHING wrong with.<br /><br />Second, Dalla, by your post alone, you would be the one who wakes up in the middle of the night, sweating and shaking worrying about EiE/DA&#039;s placement on any top ten list.&nbsp; If you really worry about that like you say you do, you might want to check yourself in to the Betty Ford Clinic.&nbsp; I have seen you around since the beginning and always considered you a nut case, thanks for reaffirming 6yrs of wonderment.<br /><br />For the majority of you guys in EiE/DA, you guys are and always have been a class act, I always considered EiE since birth to be the &#039;nice guys&#039; who own mobs dead.&nbsp; Same goes for DA, one of the eldest guilds on the server and attached to the top slot.&nbsp; However, you guys are becoming overloaded with whiny shallow little bitches.<br /><br />I hereby make my plea to the masses to change this from a nitpicking progression top 10 list to something that calibrates an overall performance for a good length of time.&nbsp; I do not think we need to measure a guild by their ability to progress alone, but by other factors also, we should take in consideration the people that make up the guild, how many bots, how much content they raid a week.&nbsp; Most importantly, if their members come to the board and spew utterings that countradict the exact words they use in the same paragraph, they automatically fall below Eelyen&#039;s guild &lt;Hasbeens&gt; (I am a member too).<br /><br />In addition to that, we really should focus on our history, seems no one is really that interested in posting a top 10 of all time list, for various reasons, top guilds progression, top guilds who create drama, top guilds who killed x,y,z mobs the most.&nbsp; Atleast we might beable to have something better to talk about than folks coming here riding their high horse with an EQ bumpersticker on it swinging their shallow morality bible at us.<br /><br />Or should I too say, nm, not my battle?&nbsp; whoops forgot to edit!</div>
