					Post by: <b>Dissonant</b> on <b>February 23, 2005, 06:09:35 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I&#039;ll give WoW some credit.. the leveling process was a lot of fun.&nbsp; XP comes very quickly, the quest system is very in-depth and the visuals are quite astounding.&nbsp; But when it comes to the high end content, you either need to be hardcore or you raid the same 4 zones over and over again.&nbsp; That wouldn&#039;t be so bad if there was a little challenge to those zones... but most were beaten on our first or second trip there with 2-3 groups.&nbsp; Untill they come out with some kind of AA system or release more high-end content(i.e. Battlegrounds), I&#039;ll most likely be on hiatus.<br /><br />I just started messing around with EQ2 and I have to say... I haven&#039;t really done a lot of adventuring, but the crafting system is astounding.&nbsp; It actually takes skill!!&nbsp; There are definitely some bugs still in the system, but they&#039;re refining it on almost a daily basis and it is truly the best crafting system in any MMOG that i&#039;ve seen.<br /><br /><br />&lt;Insert Rylden comment about me being able to play other MMOG&#039;s&gt;<br /><br />&lt;Insert my retort about the time commitment required to play casually and the time commitment to lead a guild&gt;<br /><br />There I thought I&#039;d get that out of the way.</div>
					<br />
					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Redora</b> on <b>February 23, 2005, 06:15:17 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Wow...people post about the top 10 guilds and then that post gets buried in a sea of &#039;Conviction banter&#039;. Asking AGAIN, Does ANYONE know the status of the Asian Alliance guild? Are they still in existance, raiding and taking down progression targets? If so, where are they at so they can have a representative number on the list of top 10 guilds. <br /><br />On the topic of current guild focus:<br />DN just broke into elementals. IL has been raiding mixed content...i.e. a little elemental, OoW, GoD. OA...dont hear alot from them, but they seem to be moving through elementals. <br />Please...guilds listed correct me if I&#039;m wrong here!<br /><br />UoP-I&#039;m in this so I can agree with Callon. We WILL be in PoTime soon. We nearly had Coirnav down a week ago.(23%) We do epic 1.5&#039;s fairly often. Every now and then we raid something in OoW(kind of an &#039;after-party&#039; for our normal raids)<br /><br />1.DA/EiE(Blazin&#039; the path)<br />2.Conviction(Qvic--grats)<br />3.RoS(time farm, GoD progression?)<br />4.UoP(FR,Xeg,Earth Rings/3+Arb kills)<br />5.IL(FR,Earth rings,branch out content)<br />6.OA(FR,Earth rings)<br />7.DN(FR?,havent heard much else but bitching from their O&#039;s)<br />8.BM(RZtW kill?, FR?)<br />9.LoS(Kills please!)<br />10.Who get&#039;s put here? --MYSTERY ASIAN GUILD-- (until they tell us where they belong on the list!)<br /><br />-Red-</div>
					<br />
