					Post by: <b>Shakro</b> on <b>March 07, 2005, 10:40:54 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Kinda hard to make a determination on whether EiE or DA would function at the high level they do by themselves, considering numbers.&nbsp; If they split they would both be low on numbers, which means they&#039;d both have to recruit to fill the gap, something they haven&#039;t had to do much of.&nbsp; They would have each absorbed alot of the FoT/Ascent/etc people when those guilds went south, probably, but would have still had to recruit some others.&nbsp; The sum total of an expanded 54 man EiE raid force or an expanded DA 54 man raid force would likely be less capable than the raid force the 2 guilds currently field, combined.&nbsp; But I suspect the leadership and raid experience of the members and officers of both would allow them to raid effectively and continue to push the content envelope.</div>
