					Post by: <b>simplee</b> on <b>March 07, 2005, 04:17:44 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Gear isn&#039;t everything.  Finding someone who knows how to play their class well, and who can follow instructions and knows how to raid, all falls into the picture as well.&nbsp; Not that I condone poaching... just answering your question.</div>
