					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Eh, it&#039;s been that way for some time really, since PoP, the number of guilds that had people who wandered about, and played free agency has dropped signifigantly.<br /><br />Only way to see an end to it would be a server merger.<br /><br />Don&#039;t get me wrong, not saying I approve, but since there was nothing I could do about Ascent doing the same to FoT and everyone else all the time, all I could do was refuse thier apps/alts flags, and leave it at that.<br /><br />Did it stop them? Nope.<br /><br />Did it solve anything? Nope.<br /><br />But I knew they would get nothing free from our people from that point forward, and would have to work it for themselves.</div>
