					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Thanks Redora, but you really shouldn&#039;t have to apologize on behalf of someone.... and I&#039;m not really looking for one, I just figured Mizin was too bullheaded anyway. I was just twisting the knife because I can. :)<br /><br />So, I&#039;ll answer the questions. Redora, I honestly believe that Coirnav is a harder mob than Ikkinz 1 or 2 and I would rate UoP above IL based on that.<br /><br />Mizin, I don&#039;t really watch who is doing the rating, I normally just browse them to see if any notable kills have been made. I can&#039;t tell you why others rate Ikkinz 1/2 above Coirnav. Maybe they think those encounters are harder, or maybe they just want to bust your chops. Either way, all I did was offer a suggestion that if you want to remove all doubt go and kill the mobs you say are so easy and claim the spot.</div>
