e and and click of officers hated someone else having any kind of leadership that wasn&#039;t part of that click.<br /><br />If you want to prove your better break time or get to the next part.&nbsp; You say you don&#039;t zerg ( not that is to bad of thing) prove it don&#039;t say it.&nbsp; IL has made more progress then UoP for the moment.&nbsp; Mind you they haven&#039;t killed the fish yet but they have 2 more steps in ikk 1 and 2.&nbsp; When you beat the rathe or 1 and 2 then you can say you have more progresstion then them.&nbsp; It&#039;s about progressing not about what and how many times you have killed something.&nbsp; Once you beat what they have and more then you can say you are better.</div>
