					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Gonaiel, you have NO room at ALL to talk about this here.  How long were you in the guild again? Not long I dont think.  Even before you joined, I was in it YEARS before you were.  Honestly, you really frustrated me a lot.  Before Slayyer was kicked out of UoP, he created his own little rogue faction in which he could raid with every day, and you were in this rogue faction.  In a sense, he split the guild in half.  The officers saw it in the guild&#039;s best interest to kick Slayyerr out. It wasn&#039;t between him and Migatol, it was between him and the guild.  If I remember correctly, Slayyerr sent very rude messages to the officers, though I don&#039;t have access to them.  If you remember when Migs didnt log on for a good while, back in the days we farmed VT, the guild almost fell apart. He came back, and he fixed it all.  Migatol was a GREAT guild leader. As most officers and leaders do, there is a lot that they do that we dont know about.<br /><br />Eve and Arweena, wow, what GREAT people. I am not sure if their leaving had to do with Slayyerr and Saltar or not.  IMO, the great people left when Eve and Arweena left, not when Slay was kicked out.<br /><br />As far as IL goes, isnt like half of their guild also filled with former Ascent and Time enabled people?  Doesnt DN&#039;s main tank carry and Darkblade of the Warlord? And you call us spoiled.  And about what we killed, not how many times we killed it, how has that applied to this past year at all? Wow, way to live in the past.  We farmed VT to hell, I am damn glad we did, those were great days.  Good things come to those who wait, and UoP has waited a long long time, and we finally got something we deserved.<br /><br />*edit* &quot;enables&quot; is not how you spell &quot;enabled&quot;<br /></div>
