					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">UoP couldn&#039;t do shit untill they got the lvl70 help and all the PoTime+ geared folks from ascent and such.  </div><br /><br />Now you&#039;re just making shit up, Gonaiel.  We have a very small number of Time geared people in UoP.  I don&#039;t know of anyone who was in Ascent.  There might be 1 or 2 in there, but it&#039;s not many.  We have a tank from FoT who&#039;s on some raids and sometimes main tanks.  Often people with significantly less than full elem gear are frequently the main tanks though, and our main raid leader has never been to Time.  So claiming we owe our advancement to Time geared folks is bullshit.  Does L70 help?  Well duh.  It helps everyone.<br /><br />Our biggest recent influx of members was last fall when I joined along with many other people from Tul Acharn, a pre-elemental guild, that UoP allowed a package deal with.  As you and others pointed out, Migatol is long gone and many principle raiders left a year ago or however long it was. That&#039;s going to slow any guild down.  Oh well.  UoP also does not require raid attendance.  It&#039;s more casual and we&#039;re not concerned if some other guild is progressing faster.  They&#039;re doing what they want.  Fine.  <br /><br />Carth, put the e-penis away.  Granted if you&#039;re going to whip it out this is the thread to do it in, but we don&#039;t really care about another rundown of how many people you&#039;ve killed each mob with.  Cheers for you, but Toastie is here to tell us he boxes all of it so we all suck anyway.   :cartman:  <br /><br /> :cwm39:</div>
