					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"> This line of attack shouldn&#039;t surprise me but it does.<br /><br />It may have been a while, but for those of you that do know or met us at fanfaires over the years going back to Dallas and moving forward.  One thing we always did was to share what we had.  Shared drinks, stories, and some even floorspace.<br /><br />Slayyer, the things you have said.  Leaves a foul taste in my mouth.  I do not know what your brother thinks of that or if you even care.  I really did like you guys and still do like Manntooth, but this line of attack on Kevin because you are still holding some sort of hate grudge is silly.  It is simply that kind of attitude and gameplay that has driven alot of us away from something that we really liked.  (that and real life of course)<br /><br />Everyone knows these kind of threads are silly, but some are really worked up for some reason.<br /><br />The comparisons are the most absurd.  Comparing apples to oranges.  Difficulty levels, and zones.  Sony has been repetitively changeing zones since the first person zoned into them.<br /><br />The First times Coirnav and the rathe council were attempted are not the same events that were done even a year ago.  The Rathe event has changed in difficulty about as many times as the difficulty of Plane of Time, in addition to ikki trials.  Not to mention what it even takes to get into Kod&#039;Taz now versus when the expansion was first released.<br /><br />UoP really has no raiding requirements and is still a casual guild of family and something else.  Friends<br /><br />How many casual guilds without raiding requirements are in or past Time.  It would be an extreme surprise to find more than a handful.  UoP is sitting rather nicely though and doing events and playing the game and still having fun doing that.  <br /><br />When they are not able to do time as it is approaching they more than likely will be heading to Kod&#039;Taz or any of the other vast places available.  Were not in a race anyways.  If there was one, it wasn&#039;t won on this server in a long time anyways.</div>
