					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Damn, I told myself I would never post here.&nbsp; :wtf:<br /><br />Most here don&#039;t know me and I have been out of the game for a while now but with all of the problems EQ has been having lately I have to admit that I see all of this bickering between guilds about placement on that stupid list as a good sign and I like run on sentenses.<br /><br />Guilds are progressing again and are proud of their progression and that refreshing to see.&nbsp; I think most will have to admit that a lot of guilds where hurting for a while, its good to see those that survived actually moving forward.<br /><br />Good job to everyone, you actually have me considering loging back in and checking out the fun.<br /><br />As for the bad blood between some of the people here, well.... thats just sad to see.&nbsp; Not trying to sound too much like a skirt but I know there are very few people that I have played this game with that I would not love to sit down and drink a few beers with.<br /><br />P.S. Yes I know this is a pointless, useless, stupid post but I think that it fits in very well here for that very reason.</div>
