					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">How to get Qvic gear without Qvic flags. <br /><br />Basically all you do is find 5 Qvic flaged people, and well thats easy. Take these 5 Qvic flaged people plus your self and zone into Qvic the Msha&#039;s pop every 6 hours or less I really cant remember the exact time frame, but its a short spawn. Generally late at night they are up, and one group can kill them. I assume Wari&#039;s and Prod&#039;s Qvic gear came from the piggy back fix really and nothing wrong with that. Most orginized Guilds like Conviction (I assume) and Dol/EiE wont let thier members Farm the Sha&#039;s for the final pieces of Qvic gear they need because they are still considered Raid targets. You can litterly kill them 3 times a day and they each drop 2 loots. <br /><br />They can be one grouped by people that know what they are doing easy. Other severs have problems with people that are ebayed chars that had Qvic flags, going and 4 boxing these mobs and guilds cant progress. On top of that they sell loot rights to Qvic gear in Auction channels because you can get anyone in as long as 5 are flaged. RN doesnt really have those problems, but never know might get that bad later on heh. <br /></div>
