					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I think the point is toastie, is that you come here, when you dont even play here, <div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">when i transfered to maelin umm, about a year and a half ago</div><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">even after having left the server over a year ago, and quitting eq months ago!</div><br />and you downplay people&#039;s accomplishments as often as you can.<br />Such and such can be done with 5 people.. I can 3 box this and that.. Ive done it with less...Its SO easy... Its not an accomplishment, its SO trivial.<br /><br />I think what people are trying to say is that on this server, to the majority of the people HERE, those things <span style="text-decoration: underline;">are</span> an accomplishment, <span style="text-decoration: underline;">are</span> important to THEM, and they simply think youre just nasty, and belittling, meanspirited, and ignorant of what our server cares about.<br />Which is why most people here simply glance at what you post and write it off as BS or laugh at it and shrug it off, knowing that in the end, your opinion on their accomplishments really doesnt matter.<br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">i just want to say that nothing any of your guilds does matters... why?<br />because things that your guilds do as raids.. are easily one groupable / soloable..</div><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">i&#039;ve done it with 9+ 4 bots( enc/dru for buffs, monk to pull the ring, etc), but there&#039;s a rather large equipment gap.  32, while not an accomplishment worth braging about, is still an accomplishment.</div><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">untill an elemental god, or something signifigent in kod&#039;taz + (like ikkinz raid access)   smith rondo is a pushover, so is fenninro, ive two grouped both.  so untill y&#039;all come up with something that acctualy matters</div><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">and yet you&#039;ll never know the true fun of a 4 hour + fight against the origional noqufiel before they gimped him!~</div><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">its not like any of the raids are exactly hard, when all you have to do is send a tell to someone on another server, and ask for the strat, or look it up online.</div><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">with level 70, and the hundreds of AA&#039;s added in the last couple of years,  the event is almost trivial anyways</div><br /><br />See, the accomplishments that you belittled above, were a big deal to the people that did the events. <br />While what you said about each one&#039;s triviality MAY be true, <span style="text-decoration: underline;">they</span> still worked hard, they may have even struggled with the event, and finally won something they were proud of.<br /><br />Not trying to be mean, hell, you might even be an alright guy, but if you wonder why people have this view of you, the above quotes might shed some light on the reasons. <br /><br /></div>
