					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I still play now and again, and I really don&#039;t hate EQ per sae, just that when looking at the alternatives, I just see a better product on the market now, at least in my opinion it is. People are free to disagree with me as they wish etc...<br /><br />Only time I have ever banned anyone on these boards is for selling in game items, or anonymous posters.<br /><br />Hate him, or like him, but Toastie has never hid his identity, nor tried to post with an anon name. I may not always agree with the guy either, but he tells it as he sees it, and I tend to respect that in anyone, even if I disagree with thier positions.</div>
