					Post by: <b>Givins</b> on <b>May 02, 2005, 11:43:00 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">  Ya something hapened . as UoP was starting CoH, Two groups of IL set up, pulled trigger, and blew coirnav spaw for 12 hours.<br />Odly enough that put the respawn right in IL&#039;s raid time.</div><br /><br />Between OA and UoP, we couldn&#039;t even get a shot at Coirnav.  Both OA and UoP knew damn well that we were waiting on Coirnav to get into Time, and neither guild offerred to let us have a chance at him.  If we didn&#039;t do anything, we&#039;d probably be waiting for a month to get into Time.  We had to do something.    <br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote"> Grats IL ..     you do it with class!!</div><br /><br />As has been mentioned before, it&#039;s well known that UoP is not above such tactics.  All that cock blocking that you guys had done in the past came back on you.  It&#039;s karma.  In fact, I wouldn&#039;t be surprised that the reason IL was unable to get a chance at Coirnav at all was because you guys were doing the same thing to us, and we just didn&#039;t know it.  <br /><br />Oh well, I&#039;m just glad that we are out of that little log jam.  We were starting to wonder if we&#039;d ever get a chance to kill Coirnav.  Hopefully we&#039;ll never have to compete for the same mob ever again.  </div>
