					Post by: <b>Carsonn</b> on <b>May 03, 2005, 09:33:34 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Armanthus $txt[176] May 03, 2005, 08:37:25 am</div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Carsonn $txt[176] May 03, 2005, 05:57:00 am</div><div class="quote">UoP leadship has been known to Cock Block on many things.  About Half of your leaders have been a party to that stuff and thats fine  but don&#039;t cry about it when it happens to you.<br /></div><br /><br />Examples please?<br /><br />Quote:<br />We haven&#039;t done a single Time raid yet. The reason for this is that we do not have enough yet flagged to do so. We&#039;ve been trying to catch Coir for a couple weeks now to do him again so we can move forward.<br /><br />Maybe you should raid earlier, instead of resorting to 12 people blocking a spawn so you can catch it on your raid time, when you knew damn well that guild was CoHing to attempt at the same time your 12 people were.<br /><br />Didn&#039;t we have a rule at some point that if you have the numbers in the zone you can attempt a mob? I know this has happened several times between UoP and other guilds.  It adds pressure, but it doesnt result in blown spawns.<br /><br /><br /></div><br /><br />Lets see Hegemony on the Emp for VT on many days.  It was soo bad that we had a whole guild that was keyed for VT but wouldn&#039;t go there becuase we had to spend 8 hours camping the emp.  Lets see forsaken on the cursed where we would kill taskmaskers till we got enough on even though we were fully emp keyed just to put the spawn off till we could get enough.&nbsp; Do you want more?&nbsp; Ask any conviction member about the time in tactics when you cried bloody murder when they wouldn&#039;t let you have the RZTW event after you failed and then had the worthless migatol post on there forums about how you never did any of that to anyone before and whine whine whine cry cry cry.&nbsp; Half of your officers where officers when that crap happened but not one of you said anything about it since you guys dont do that thing and its not classy but you did it anyhow.&nbsp; Do you want more ?</div>
