					Title: <b>Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</b><br />
					Post by: <b>Gixxdinree</b> on <b>May 03, 2005, 04:22:07 pm</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Diplomacy was tried between the leaders.  An agreement could not be reached.  However since everyone had the policy of killing it when it was up regardless of who needed it for what... thus blocking each other from it... Wari took matters into his own hands because IL could not get the mob on their time... I don’t agree with the tactics, in fact I almost didn’t raid that night, but what’s done is done and IL will NOT go after that mob again.. IL wanted only ONE kill of that particular mob (most mobs we like 2 but 2 wasn’t worth the hassle for this mob) and to make sure we didn’t need to even attempt it again, we invited everyone we could that was willing to come… even an OA member or 2.<br /><br />OA had every right to go after that mob when it was up, it wasn’t very…err…nice.. I guess.. of them to do that when there are other things they need besides Corinav to progress and other guilds only need that mob, but that doesn’t put them in the wrong.<br /><br />UoP had the same right and they need that mob to progress immediately, but they already had a kill... still they had the right.<br /><br />IL also had the same right to go after it, but it was seldom on their time, and when it was, it was on an off night when it is difficult to gather the players/classes needed to kill that mob which made them frustrated.  So they did something kinda shady to get it on their time… we got our kill, we wont take Corinav again, I hope you don’t hold it against IL for being frustrated with the whole situation and taking matters into their own hands.<br /><br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">We did this content 2+ years ago that your doing now, it&#039;s not like we don&#039;t know what we&#039;re talking about</div><br /><br />Well were doing it now, and some things have changed again. Something that is trivial to you might not be so trivial to us. And what worked for you doesn&#039;t nessicaraly work for us.&nbsp; Strat help is fine, encuragement is fine, telling us how to run our guilds is not.<br /><br />--Gixxdinree<br />--Offcer of Inner Loop<br /></div>
