					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">Hehe Hey Kilaer, how is EQ2? Bet it is less dramatic as EQ.<br /><br />I think it&#039;s a buncha horseshit how people think this is anything new in EQ. Hell even during PoP when not even 1 guild had made it to time due to bugs n shit with the flags people where STILL fighting over AoW so please don&#039;t act like fighting over old mobs/content is anything new. Time Gear is still the best damn farm gear until you get into an Anguish type guild who is still playing around in GoD zones (Qvic+) So I can totally understand why people are pissed about it, however, I am also very understanding about the lack of caring for the e-penis going on in these forums. <br /><br />I think what SoE should have done is made it a GUILD flag so if the guild gets past the content the *guild* is flaged NOT the player. That way if you leave X guild then you loose the flag and can no longer enter that zone until you either join a new guild that has the zone flag or join a guild that defeats the damn content again. Basically as long as that guild stays together all the players in it can go into those zones. I think it would make for interesting times when a guild folds. I think more players would bust their ass not to let a guild fold as easy. Then you also would not have the oh I got this shit on my own syndrom and people would see hey this guild and it&#039;s members got me what I have. </div>
