					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">No, what&#039;s really funny is that I didn&#039;t comment at all about how valid his opinion was or not, but you can&#039;t read. Now that&#039;s amusing, good sir! Oh, ha ha...jolly good!<br /></div><br /><br />Really?<br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">I simply said I didn&#039;t give a crap about his retired, trolling opinion...<br /></div><br /><br />Actually what you said was this...<br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Why don&#039;t you go post suggestions for the game you actually play where people might give a crap</div><br /><br />You didn&#039;t say &quot;I&quot; you said &quot;people&quot;.&nbsp; You were speaking for, arguably, the entire EQ community, and at the minimum the people here on this board.<br /><br />If Matteo&#039;s statement was valid, but you don&#039;t &quot;give a crap&quot; simply because he&#039;s retired.... well...you&#039;re a bigot.&nbsp; I was giving you the benefit of the doubt with the invalid remark.&nbsp; If you think his statement was valid, you&#039;ve got a much bigger problem.<br /><br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">I, and probably the majority of the mid-level raiders on this board, am just plain tired of the constant condescending attitude that your type constantly spew.<br /></div><br /><br />If Matteo was being pretentious I could see your point.&nbsp; But he&#039;s not, he&#039;s been there, he&#039;s done it.&nbsp; He has as much experience with Coirnav and Guild Politics as you, and quite possibly more.&nbsp; (He was the leader of DA if you didn&#039;t know)<br /><div class="smalltext">Quote:</div><div class="quote">Toastie&#039;s posts, for example, are about as useful as a case of the clap and serve no other purpose other than to belittle the majority of the people who still play on RN and to inflate his own, apparently very very needy, ego.<br /></div><br 