					Post by: <b>Kinladar</b> on <b>June 29, 2005, 07:37:46 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">That was one of the gayer things about Plane of Air. Some good loots could drop from some of them tho.<br /><br />Plane of earth had some clearing, but not to the level that air needed. Fire wasn&#039;t bad either. Water was just a pain due to the fact you were underwater, but overall, you could clear all the water nameds in a bit over an hour or so if you were focused.<br /><br />That was kinda our golden age, farming the bejebus outta the elementals, because there was no competition for the most part at the begining for us.</div>
